var e=[{word:`anyone`,translation:`pron. 任何人`,phonetic:`'ɛnɪ'wʌn`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Anyone could win tonight.`,cn:`今晚任何人都可能赢。`},{en:`They offer help and advice to anyone interested in becoming a teacher.`,cn:`他们为任何有兴趣当老师的人提供帮助和咨询。`},{en:`If anyone sees Lisa, ask her to call me.`,cn:`如果有谁看见莉萨，叫她打电话给我。`},{en:`Anyone else who is interested in going on the trip should see me at the end of this lesson.`,cn:`还有谁有兴趣参加此次旅行，下课来找我。`}]},{word:`anywhere`,translation:`adv. 任何地方; pron. 任何(一个)地方`,phonetic:`'ɛnɪwɛr`,partOfSpeech:`adv / pron`,examples:[{en:`Sit anywhere you like.`,cn:`你随便坐吧。`},{en:`You can buy clothes like these anywhere.`,cn:`这样的衣服到处都可以买到。`},{en:`I don’t want to live in London, but I’d be happy living anywhere else .`,cn:`我不想住在伦敦，但是住在其他什么地方我都很乐意。`}]},{word:`wonderful`,translation:`adj. 精彩的；极好的`,phonetic:`ˈwʌndɚfəl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The cold, misty air felt wonderful on his face.`,cn:`那凉凉的雾气使他脸上感觉好极了。`},{en:`It's wonderful to see you.`,cn:`见到你好极了。`}]},{word:`few`,translation:`adj. 很少的；; n. 少量`,phonetic:`fju`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n`,examples:[{en:`...spending her few waking hours in front of the TV.`,cn:`…把她清醒的个把钟头花在电视机前。`}]},{word:`quite a few`,translation:`相当多；不少(后接可数名词)`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I can name quite a few of these but one of the more sensitive conditions is female incontinence.`,cn:`我能说出相当多疾病的名字而其中一个比较敏感的就是女性尿失禁。`},{en:`I personally know quite a few intelligent people who (in certain situations and circumstances) can be kinda stupid. I'm know 'cause I'm one of them!`,cn:`我个人知道相当多的一些有才智的人，在某些情况和场景下，是有一些愚蠢，因为我也是其中之一。`}]},{word:`most`,translation:`adj. 最多的；大多数的`,phonetic:`most`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The president himself won the most votes.`,cn:`总统本人赢得了最多的选票。`}]},{word:`something`,translation:`pron. 某事物`,phonetic:`'sʌmθɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`There’s something in my eye.`,cn:`我眼睛里有什么东西。`},{en:`Sarah said something about coming over later.`,cn:`萨拉说她等一会儿过来什么的。`},{en:`I don’t know what he does exactly, but I know it has something to do with computers (= is related to them in some way ) .`,cn:`我不知道他具体是干什么的，只知道和电脑有关。`}]},{word:`nothing`,translation:`pron. 没有什么; n. 没有`,phonetic:`'nʌθɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`pron / n`,examples:[{en:`Nothing ever happens in this town.`,cn:`这镇上从来都不会发生什么特别的事。`},{en:`There’s nothing in this box.`,cn:`这盒子里什么也没有。`},{en:`There was nothing else the doctors could do.`,cn:`医生们没有别的办法了。`},{en:`He had nothing more to say.`,cn:`他没有更多要说的了。`},{en:`We know nothing about her family.`,cn:`我们对她的家庭一无所知。`},{en:`I couldn’t just stand by and do nothing.`,cn:`我不能就那样袖手旁观。`},{en:`I promised to say nothing about it to anyone.`,cn:`我答应这件事对谁也不说。`},{en:`We’ve heard nothing from her for weeks.`,cn:`我们好几个星期没有她的音信了。`},{en:`There’s absolutely nothing to be ashamed of.`,cn:`根本没有什么好难为情的。`},{en:`‘Do you know much about business?’ ‘Nothing at all.’`,cn:`“你对做生意了解得多吗？”“一窍不通。”`},{en:`She had eaten virtually nothing at supper.`,cn:`晚饭她几乎什么也没吃。`},{en:`There’s nothing wrong with the data.`,cn:`这些数据没什么差错。`},{en:`There’s nothing new about this.`,cn:`这没有什么新鲜的。`},{en:`A brief search was made but they found nothing untoward.`,cn:`他们简单地搜查了一番，没发现任何异常。`}]},{word:`everyone`,translation:`pron. 每人；人人`,phonetic:`'ɛvrɪwʌn`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`If everyone is ready, I’ll begin.`,cn:`如果大家都准备好了，我就开始。`},{en:`Send my best wishes to everyone in the family.`,cn:`请向全家人致以最美好的祝愿。`},{en:`Of course everyone else thought it was hilarious!`,cn:`当然其他所有人都觉得好笑极了！`},{en:`Not everyone enjoys sport.`,cn:`并不是谁都喜欢体育运动的。`}]},{word:`of course`,translation:`当然`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Well, she won, of course.`,cn:`噢，当然是她赢啦。`},{en:`You should of course keep copies of all your correspondence.`,cn:`你当然应该保留所有信函的复印件。`},{en:`Of course there will be some difficult times ahead.`,cn:`今后当然会有遇到困难的时候。`}]},{word:`myself`,translation:`pron. 我自己`,phonetic:`maɪ'sɛlf`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`I blame myself for what has happened.`,cn:`发生这一切都怪我自己。`},{en:`I can look after myself.`,cn:`我可以照顾好自己。`},{en:`I’m making myself a sandwich.`,cn:`我在给自己做三明治。`}]},{word:`yourself`,translation:`pron. 你自己；你亲自`,phonetic:`jɔr'sɛlf`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Look at yourself in the mirror.`,cn:`照照镜子吧。`},{en:`Come and warm yourselves by the fire.`,cn:`到火边来暖暖身子。`},{en:`Have you hurt yourself?`,cn:`你伤到自己了吗？`},{en:`Go and buy yourself an ice cream.`,cn:`去给你自己买个冰激凌吧。`}]},{word:`hen`,translation:`n. 母鸡；雌禽`,phonetic:`hɛn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The chickens gathered under the hen.`,cn:`小鸡聚集在母鸡翅膀下面。`},{en:`The hen sits in the hencoop [henroost].`,cn:`母鸡卧窝。`},{en:`What Jones and her colleagues wanted to learn is whether a happy hen in fact produces a better product.`,cn:`琼斯和她的同事们希望弄明白，是否一只幸福的母鸡确实产出更好的产品。`}]},{word:`pig`,translation:`n. 猪`,phonetic:`pɪɡ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He kept pigs and poultry.`,cn:`他养过猪和家禽。`}]},{word:`seem`,translation:`v. 似乎；好像`,phonetic:`sim`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Ann didn’t seem very sure.`,cn:`安看来并不十分肯定。`},{en:`It seems a foolish decision now.`,cn:`现在看来这是一个愚蠢的决定。`},{en:`It seems like you’re catching a cold, Taylor.`,cn:`你好像感冒了，泰勒。`},{en:`‘So Bill’s leaving her?’ ‘ So it seems (= that seems to be true ) .’`,cn:`“这么说来，比尔要离开她？”“好像是这样。”`}]},{word:`bored`,translation:`adj. 无聊的；厌烦的；郁闷的`,phonetic:`bɔrd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`He was easily bored.`,cn:`他很容易感到厌烦。`},{en:`After a while, I got bored and left.`,cn:`过了一会儿，我觉得无聊，就走了。`}]},{word:`someone`,translation:`pron. 某人；有人`,phonetic:`'sʌmwʌn`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`What would you do if someone tried to rob you in the street?`,cn:`要是有人在街上抢劫你，你会怎么办？`},{en:`Will someone please explain what’s going on?`,cn:`谁能说说是怎么回事？`},{en:`Have Brooks or someone fax this to New York right away.`,cn:`叫布鲁克斯或谁立刻把这个发传真到纽约。`}]},{word:`diary`,translation:`n. 日记；日记簿`,phonetic:`'daɪəri`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Inge kept a diary (= wrote in a diary ) during the war years.`,cn:`英奇在战争年代里一直写日记。`}]},{word:`activity`,translation:`n. 活动；活跃`,phonetic:`ækˈtɪvətɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Everyone is free to engage in peaceful political activity.`,cn:`每个人都可以自由参加和平的政治活动。`},{en:`fund-raising activities`,cn:`筹款活动`},{en:`Regular physical activity helps to control your weight.`,cn:`定期参加体育活动有助于控制体重。`}]},{word:`decide`,translation:`v. 决定；选定(decide to do sth)`,phonetic:`dɪ'saɪd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Has anything been decided yet?`,cn:`已经作出什么决定了吗？`},{en:`The trainees decide among themselves what programs to take.`,cn:`受训者自行选择课程。`},{en:`After a long discussion, they decided in favour of (= chose ) the older applicant.`,cn:`经过长时间的讨论，他们决定选那位较年长的求职者。`}]},{word:`try`,translation:`v. 尝试；设法；努力  (try to do sth /try doing sth)`,phonetic:`traɪ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Let’s have a rest and then we’ll try again.`,cn:`我们休息一下，然后再试。`},{en:`I tried everything to lose weight with no success.`,cn:`我试了各种方法减肥，但都没有成功。`},{en:`I tried and tried (= kept making an effort ) and eventually I was offered a job.`,cn:`我一次次地尝试，终于有人给了我一份工作。`},{en:`Try as he might (= as hard as he could ) , he could not get the incident out of his mind.`,cn:`他想尽办法，但脑子里仍摆脱不掉那件事。`}]},{word:`paragliding`,translation:`n. 空中滑翔跳伞`,phonetic:`'pærəɡlaɪdɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Adventurous travelers can go heli-skiing, paragliding and bungee jumping.`,cn:`好冒险的旅行者可以去高山滑雪，空中滑翔跳伞和蹦极。`}]},{word:`feel like(doing sth.)`,translation:`想要`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`bird`,translation:`n. 鸟；禽`,phonetic:`bɝd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`wild birds`,cn:`野鸟`},{en:`The dawn was filled with the sound of birds.`,cn:`黎明时分，鸟鸣声不绝于耳。`},{en:`a flock of birds`,cn:`一群飞鸟`},{en:`a wooden bird cage`,cn:`木制鸟笼`}]},{word:`bicycle`,translation:`n. 自行车`,phonetic:`'baɪsɪkl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Can James ride a bicycle yet?`,cn:`詹姆斯会骑自行车了吗？`}]},{word:`building`,translation:`n. 建筑物`,phonetic:`'bɪldɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The offices are on the top two floors of the building.`,cn:`办公室在大楼最高的两层。`},{en:`a farmhouse and other farm buildings`,cn:`农舍以及其他的农场建筑`}]},{word:`trader`,translation:`n. 商人`,phonetic:`'tredɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Market traders display an exotic selection of the island's produce.`,cn:`市场商家们展示了该岛具有异国情调的农产品系列。`}]},{word:`wonder`,translation:`v. 想知道；惊奇；怀疑`,phonetic:`'wʌndɚ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`What are they going to do now, I wonder ?`,cn:`我想知道，他们现在打算怎么办呢？`},{en:`He’s been leaving work early a lot – it makes you wonder , doesn’t it?`,cn:`他最近经常提早下班——让人觉得奇怪，是不是？`},{en:`Sometimes I wonder about his behaviour.`,cn:`有时我对他的行为感到惊讶。`},{en:`‘Is she serious?’ ‘I wonder.’`,cn:`“她是认真的吗？”“我怀疑。”`}]},{word:`difference`,translation:`n. 差异；不同`,phonetic:`'dɪfrəns`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There’s a world of difference (= there’s a very big difference ) between us.`,cn:`我们之间有着天壤之别。`}]},{word:`top`,translation:`n. 顶部；顶`,phonetic:`tɑp`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I waited at the top of the stairs.`,cn:`我在楼梯顶端上等着。`}]},{word:`wait`,translation:`v. 等；等待(wait for)`,phonetic:`wet`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Hurry up! Everyone’s waiting.`,cn:`快点！大家在等着呢。`},{en:`Would you mind waiting outside?`,cn:`你在外面等好吗？`},{en:`We’ve been waiting ages.`,cn:`我们已经等了很长时间了。`}]},{word:`umbrella`,translation:`n. 伞；雨伞`,phonetic:`ʌm'brɛlə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It started to rain, so Tricia stopped to put up her umbrella.`,cn:`开始下雨了，所以特里西娅停下来撑起雨伞。`},{en:`I spent the day on the beach, lying under a beach umbrella, reading.`,cn:`那天我就在海滩上度过，躺在海滩遮阳伞下面看书。`}]},{word:`wet`,translation:`adj. 湿的；雨天的；雨天的`,phonetic:`wɛt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I’ve washed your shirt but it’s still wet.`,cn:`我把你的衬衫洗过了，不过现在还是湿的。`},{en:`wet grass`,cn:`湿草地`},{en:`The man in the boat was wet through (= completely wet ).`,cn:`船上的那人浑身湿透。`},{en:`There’s more wet weather on the way.`,cn:`未来还有更多湿雨天气。`}]},{word:`because of`,translation:`因为；由于`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`His business went under because of competition from the large corporations.`,cn:`由于大公司的竞争，他的生意陷入了困境。`},{en:`There were fewer temporary engineers to plug in in that city because of low pay.`,cn:`由于报酬低，该城市雇用得到的临时工程师就更少了。`},{en:`Many species are in peril of extinction because of our destruction of their natural habitat.`,cn:`许多物种由于我们破坏了它们的自然环境， 现在正面临灭绝的危险。`}]},{word:`below`,translation:`prep. 低于；在...下面; adv. 在...下面`,phonetic:`bɪ'lo`,partOfSpeech:`prep / adv`,examples:[{en:`He had a bruise just below his right eye.`,cn:`就在他的右眼下面有一块伤痕。`}]},{word:`enough`,translation:`adj. 足够的; adv. 足够地；充分地`,phonetic:`ɪ'nʌf`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`Her disappearance and death would give proof enough of Charles' guilt.`,cn:`她的失踪和死亡将提供足够的证据证明查尔斯有罪。`}]},{word:`hungry`,translation:`adj. (反full)饥饿的；渴望的`,phonetic:`ˈhʌŋgrɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I was cold, tired, and hungry.`,cn:`我又冷，又累，又饿。`},{en:`If you get hungry , there’s some cold chicken in the fridge.`,cn:`你要是饿了，冰箱里有些冷鸡肉。`},{en:`Do you still feel hungry?`,cn:`你还觉得饿吗？`},{en:`She is hungry for success.`,cn:`她渴望成功。`}]},{word:`as`,translation:`conj. 如同；像一样`,phonetic:`æz; əz`,partOfSpeech:`conj`,examples:[{en:`Do as I say!`,cn:`按我说的去做！`}]},{word:`hill`,translation:`n. 小山；丘陵；山冈；斜坡`,phonetic:`hɪl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Their house is on a hill overlooking the sea.`,cn:`他们的房子建在可以俯视大海的小山上。`},{en:`A cart was making its way up the hill.`,cn:`一辆马车正在爬上山丘。`},{en:`There’s a steep hill ahead.`,cn:`前面有个陡坡。`}]},{word:`duck`,translation:`n. 鸭；鸭肉`,phonetic:`dʌk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Chickens and ducks scratch around the outbuildings.`,cn:`鸡鸭在外屋四周挖扒。`},{en:`roast duck with orange sauce`,cn:`烤鸭配橘子酱`}]},{word:`dislike`,translation:`v. 不喜欢；厌恶; n. 不喜爱；厌恶；反感`,phonetic:`dɪs'laɪk`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Why do you dislike her so much?`,cn:`你为什么那么讨厌她？`},{en:`They took an instant dislike to each other (= they disliked each other immediately ) .`,cn:`他俩立刻就互相讨厌对方了。`}]},{word:`have a good time`,translation:`v. 等于enjoy oneself/have fun(doing sth)玩得痛快`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`v`},{word:`Huangguoshu waterfall`,translation:`n. 黄果树瀑布`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`After a quick lunch, I moved on to the central attraction of this area, the giant Huangguoshu waterfall.`,cn:`匆匆吃过午饭以后，我动身前往这个景区的中心景点黄果树大瀑布。`}]},{word:`Hong Kong`,translation:`n. 香港`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They cruised to Hong Kong on their vacation.`,cn:`他们在假期里到香港去游览。`}]},{word:`Weld Quay`,translation:`海乾街/码头, 位于马来西亚槟城岛(州)`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`tian'anmen square`,translation:`天安门广场`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`the Palace Museum`,translation:`故宫博物院`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`housework`,translation:`n. 家务劳动`,phonetic:`'haʊs'wɝk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Men are doing more housework nowadays.`,cn:`现今男人正在承担越来越多的家务。`}]},{word:`hardly`,translation:`adv. 几乎不；简直不；刚刚`,phonetic:`'hɑrdli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`My parents divorced when I was six, and I hardly knew my father.`,cn:`我六岁时父母离婚，我对父亲几乎一无所知。`},{en:`The children were so excited they could hardly speak.`,cn:`孩子们兴奋得几乎连话都说不出来了。`},{en:`I can hardly believe it.`,cn:`这简直让我难以置信。`},{en:`Hardly anyone (= almost no one ) writes to me these days.`,cn:`如今几乎没有人给我写信了。`},{en:`Dad ate hardly anything (= almost nothing ).`,cn:`爸爸几乎没吃什么东西。`},{en:`There was hardly any (= very little ) traffic.`,cn:`路上车少人稀。`},{en:`She lives in Spain, so we hardly ever (= almost never ) see her.`,cn:`她住在西班牙，所以我们几乎见不到她。`},{en:`The building work has hardly begun.`,cn:`施工才刚刚开始。`}]},{word:`ever`,translation:`adv. 在任何时候`,phonetic:`'ɛvɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Nothing ever seems to upset him.`,cn:`似乎从来没有什么事情会使他烦恼。`},{en:`Have you ever been to Paris?`,cn:`你去过巴黎吗？`},{en:`I don’t think I’ve ever been here before.`,cn:`我觉得我以前从未到过这里。`},{en:`If you’re ever in Seattle, come and see me.`,cn:`如果你什么时候到了西雅图，就来看我吧。`}]},{word:`hardly ever`,translation:`很少；几乎从不；难得`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Shy people find conversation difficult; they hardly ever speak up because they're too busy worrying about the impression they're making.`,cn:`害羞的人觉得交谈很困难；他们几乎从来不大声说话，因为他们太忙于顾虑自己给别人留下的印象。`}]},{word:`once`,translation:`adv. 一次；曾经`,phonetic:`wʌns`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I’ve only met her once.`,cn:`我只见过她一面。`},{en:`Paul’s been to Wexford once before.`,cn:`保罗曾去过韦克斯福德一次。`}]},{word:`twice`,translation:`adv. 两次；两倍`,phonetic:`twaɪs`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`He was questioned by police twice yesterday.`,cn:`他昨天被警察审问了两次。`},{en:`None of our dinner menus are exactly the same twice over .`,cn:`我们的晚餐菜单从没有完全重样的。`},{en:`They employ 90 people, twice as many as last year.`,cn:`他们雇用了90人，是去年的两倍。`}]},{word:`Internet`,translation:`n. 因特网`,phonetic:`'ɪntɚnɛt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Do you have access to the Internet?`,cn:`你上得了网吗？`}]},{word:`program`,translation:`n. 程序；节目；节目单；课程`,phonetic:`'proɡræm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a word processing program`,cn:`文字处理程序`},{en:`Stanford University’s MBA program`,cn:`斯坦福大学的工商管理硕士课程`}]},{word:`full`,translation:`adj. 满的；充满的；完全的`,phonetic:`fʊl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The train was completely full.`,cn:`火车坐得满满的。`},{en:`Don’t talk with your mouth full.`,cn:`嘴里塞满东西时不要说话。`},{en:`The class is full, but you can register for next term.`,cn:`这个班已经满了，不过你可以注册下学期的。`},{en:`The bath was full to the brim (= completely full ) with hot water.`,cn:`浴缸里满满一缸热水。`},{en:`The Health Centre offers a full range of services.`,cn:`医疗中心提供全套服务。`}]},{word:`swing`,translation:`n. 摇摆；秋千; v. 摇摆；旋转`,phonetic:`swɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`kids playing on the swings`,cn:`荡秋千的孩子们`},{en:`a porch swing`,cn:`门廊上的秋千`},{en:`He took a swing at (= tried to hit ) my head and missed.`,cn:`他挥拳向我头部打来，但没有打中`},{en:`Let your arms swing as you walk.`,cn:`边走边摆动双臂。`}]},{word:`swing dance`,translation:`摇摆舞`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`They're learning to swing dance in a class called whole body thinking.`,cn:`他们正在一节叫做“全身思考”的课堂中学习摇摆舞。`},{en:`Rachel's dream has, for years now, been to be a professional swing dance instructor (specifically a Lindy Hop instructor).`,cn:`瑞秋很多年来都梦想去成为一名职业的摇摆舞教练，特别是林迪舞教练。`}]},{word:`maybe`,translation:`adv. 或许；也许；可能`,phonetic:`'mebi`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Maybe it’s all just a big misunderstanding.`,cn:`也许这只是一个很大的误会。`},{en:`‘Do you think he’ll come back?’ ‘Maybe.’`,cn:`“你认为他会回来吗？”“也许会吧。”`},{en:`Maybe they’re right, but maybe not .`,cn:`也许他们是对的，但也许不是。`},{en:`You have talent, maybe even genius.`,cn:`你很有才能，甚至可以说有天赋。`},{en:`He said he’d finish the work soon – maybe tomorrow.`,cn:`他说他很快就会完成那项工作——也许是明天。`}]},{word:`least`,translation:`adj. 最小的；最少的`,phonetic:`list`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I try to offend the least amount of people possible.`,cn:`我尽可能少得罪人。`}]},{word:`at least`,translation:`至少`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I resolved to visit my grandmother at least once a year.`,cn:`我决定每年至少要去看望祖母一次。`}]},{word:`junk`,translation:`n. 垃圾；废旧杂物`,phonetic:`dʒʌŋk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`This cupboard’s full of junk.`,cn:`这个壁橱里塞满了杂物。`}]},{word:`junk food`,translation:`n. 垃圾食品；无营养食品`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Sharon fears that her love of junk food may have contributed to her cancer.`,cn:`莎伦怕她对垃圾食品的喜好可能导致了她的癌症。`}]},{word:`coffee`,translation:`n. 咖啡；咖啡色`,phonetic:`'kɔfi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Do you want a cup of coffee?`,cn:`你要来杯咖啡吗？`},{en:`Do you like your coffee white (= with milk ) or black (= without milk ) ?`,cn:`你的咖啡要加奶还是不加奶？`}]},{word:`health`,translation:`n. 健康；人的身体或精神状态`,phonetic:`hɛlθ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I’m worried about my husband’s health.`,cn:`我担心我丈夫的健康状况。`}]},{word:`result`,translation:`n. 结果；后果`,phonetic:`rɪ'zʌlt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`High unemployment is a direct result of the recession.`,cn:`高失业率是经济衰退的直接后果。`},{en:`Growing plants from seed can produce disappointing results .`,cn:`将种子培育成植株，有时会产生令人失望的结果。`},{en:`With a little effort you should achieve the desired result .`,cn:`只要稍作努力，你就可以取得预期的效果。`}]},{word:`percent`,translation:`adj. 百分之百的`,phonetic:`pɚ'sɛnt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I agree with you a hundred percent.`,cn:`我百分之百同意你的看法。`}]},{word:`online`,translation:`adj. 在线的; adv. 在线地`,phonetic:`'ɑn'laɪn`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`All the city’s schools will be online by the end of the year.`,cn:`到年底，市里的所有学校都会连接因特网。`},{en:`...the cool stuff you find online.`,cn:`…你在网上找到的好东西。`}]},{word:`television`,translation:`n. 电视机；电视节目`,phonetic:`tɛləˌvɪʒən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Lucy turned on the television to watch the evening news.`,cn:`露西打开电视收看晚间新闻。`},{en:`They have a television in every room.`,cn:`他们每个房间都配有电视。`},{en:`In the evenings I like to relax and watch television.`,cn:`晚上，我喜欢放松下来，看看电视。`}]},{word:`although`,translation:`conj. 虽然；尽管；然而；可是`,phonetic:`ɔl'ðo`,partOfSpeech:`conj`,examples:[{en:`Although in poor health, she continued to carry out her duties.`,cn:`尽管身体不好，她仍继续执行任务。`},{en:`We decided to take rooms in Longwood House, although we knew we could not really afford the rent.`,cn:`虽然我们知道自己其实付不起租金，但还是决定住朗伍德庄园的房间。`},{en:`Although I can’t help admiring the man’s courage, I do not approve of his methods.`,cn:`尽管我不得不佩服那个男子的勇气，却并不赞成他的方法。`},{en:`You can copy down my answers, although I’m not sure they’re right.`,cn:`你可以抄我的答案，但是我不敢肯定我答得是否正确。`}]},{word:`through`,translation:`prep. 穿过；一直到；凭借`,phonetic:`θru`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`She smiled at him as he walked through the door.`,cn:`他从门口进来时，她朝他笑了。`},{en:`Water will be pumped through a pipe.`,cn:`水将通过管子抽上来。`},{en:`I managed to squeeze through a gap in the hedge.`,cn:`我设法从篱笆上的一个缺口挤了过去。`},{en:`They were suddenly plunged into darkness as the train went through a tunnel.`,cn:`火车穿过隧道，他们顿时陷入黑暗之中。`},{en:`There were people standing in the doorway and I couldn’t get through.`,cn:`有人站在门口，我过不去。`},{en:`She got her first job through an employment agency.`,cn:`她通过职业介绍所得到了第一份工作。`}]},{word:`mind`,translation:`n. 头脑；想法；意见；心思`,phonetic:`maɪnd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It is impossible to understand the complex nature of the human mind .`,cn:`要想了解人类思维复杂的特性是不可能的。`},{en:`Mind and body are closely related.`,cn:`思想和肉体紧密相连。`},{en:`Meditation involves focusing the mind on a single object or word.`,cn:`冥想需要把思想集中在一个物体或单词上。`}]},{word:`body`,translation:`n. 身体`,phonetic:`'bɑdi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the human body`,cn:`人体`},{en:`My fingers were numb and my whole body ached.`,cn:`我手指麻木，浑身疼痛。`},{en:`He needs to overcome a negative body image (=  what you think about your own body  ) .`,cn:`他需要克服对自己身体的负面印象。`}]},{word:`such`,translation:`adj. 这样的；如此的`,phonetic:`sʌtʃ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`How dared they do such a thing?`,cn:`他们怎么敢做出这样的事?`},{en:`He would not succumb to such an item.`,cn:`他不会对这样的条款做出让步的。`},{en:`How can you explain such a silly remark?`,cn:`你怎能解释这样一个愚蠢的意见?`}]},{word:`such as`,translation:`例如；诸如`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`together`,translation:`adv. 共同；一起`,phonetic:`tə'ɡɛðɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`We’ve very much enjoyed working together .`,cn:`我们在一起工作非常开心。`},{en:`They’ve decided to spend more time together.`,cn:`他们决定要花更多时间在一起。`},{en:`He and my father were at school together.`,cn:`他和我父亲一起上过学。`},{en:`Together they went back inside the villa.`,cn:`他们一起回到了别墅里。`}]},{word:`die`,translation:`v. 死；枯竭；消失`,phonetic:`daɪ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`He died in 1985 at the age of 76.`,cn:`他1985年去世，终年76岁。`},{en:`Her father died suddenly in an accident when she was only ten.`,cn:`她年仅10岁时父亲突然死于一场意外事故。`},{en:`She died peacefully in her sleep at the age of 98.`,cn:`她在睡眠中安然辞世，享年98岁。`},{en:`The bullet went straight through his head, and he died instantly .`,cn:`子弹穿过他的头部，他当场死亡。`},{en:`Our love will never die.`,cn:`我们的爱始终不渝。`}]},{word:`writer`,translation:`n. 作者；作家`,phonetic:`'raɪtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She’s one of my favourite writers.`,cn:`她是我最喜欢的作家之一。`},{en:`a science-fiction writer`,cn:`科幻小说作家`}]},{word:`dentist`,translation:`n. 牙科医生`,phonetic:`'dɛntɪst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Visit your dentist twice a year for a checkup.`,cn:`每年看两次牙医做检查。`}]},{word:`magazine`,translation:`n. 杂志`,phonetic:`'mæɡəzin`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a magazine article`,cn:`杂志中的文章`},{en:`She glanced over the magazine racks.`,cn:`她扫了一眼杂志架。`}]},{word:`however`,translation:`adv. 然而；无论如何；不管多么`,phonetic:`haʊ'ɛvɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`This is a cheap and simple process. However, there are dangers.`,cn:`这是个花钱少而又简单的方法，不过有危险。`},{en:`an extremely unpleasant disease that is, however, easy to treat`,cn:`一种让人极其难受却容易治疗的病`},{en:`You should report any incident, however minor it is.`,cn:`任何事件你都应该汇报，不管它多小。`}]},{word:`than`,translation:`conj. 比`,phonetic:`ðæn`,partOfSpeech:`conj`,examples:[{en:`Natalie was prettier than her sister.`,cn:`纳塔莉比她姐姐漂亮。`},{en:`You need that money more than I do.`,cn:`你比我更需要那笔钱。`},{en:`There were more people there than I expected.`,cn:`那里的人比我预想的要多。`},{en:`If it costs more than $60, I won’t buy it.`,cn:`如果价格超过60美元，我就不买了。`},{en:`She had woken even earlier than usual.`,cn:`她甚至比平时醒得更早。`},{en:`Divorce is more common than it was a generation ago.`,cn:`现在离婚比上一代人常见了。`}]},{word:`more than`,translation:`超过；多于；；不仅仅；非常`,phonetic:`mɔr ðæn`,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`almost`,translation:`adv. 几乎；差不多`,phonetic:`'ɔlmost`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Have you almost finished?`,cn:`你差不多完成了吗？`},{en:`Supper’s almost ready.`,cn:`晚饭就要做好了。`},{en:`It was almost midnight.`,cn:`午夜将至。`},{en:`Almost nothing was done to improve the situation.`,cn:`几乎没有采取什么措施来改善这个情况。`},{en:`The story is almost certainly true.`,cn:`这故事几乎肯定是真实的。`},{en:`He’s almost as old as I am.`,cn:`他差不多跟我一样大。`}]},{word:`none`,translation:`pron. 没有人；没有任何东西，毫无`,phonetic:`nʌn`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`I wish I could offer you some cake but there’s none left.`,cn:`我真想能请你吃些蛋糕，但一点也没剩的了。`},{en:`Although these were good students, none had a score above 60.`,cn:`虽然这些都是好学生，但是没有一个考到60分以上。`},{en:`She waited for a reply, but none came.`,cn:`她等着答复，可是什么也没等到。`},{en:`Even an old car is better than none.`,cn:`有一辆旧车也比没有车强。`}]},{word:`less`,translation:`adj. 更少的；较少的`,phonetic:`lɛs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Maybe he would worry less if he understood the situation.`,cn:`他要是了解情况，也许就不会那么担心了。`}]},{word:`less than`,translation:`不到；少于`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Spend less than you earn, go without until you have the money.`,cn:`一定要比自己挣的花的少，如果没有那么多钱，就不要行动。`},{en:`At this stage, you begin settling for less than what you deserve.`,cn:`在这个阶段，尽管你得到的比应得的要少，但你还是勉强接受。`}]},{word:`point`,translation:`n. 看法；要点；重点；小数点；目标；分数`,phonetic:`pɔɪnt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`That’s a very interesting point.`,cn:`那个观点很有趣。`},{en:`She made some extremely good points.`,cn:`她提出了一些很不错的观点。`},{en:`There are three important points we must bear in mind.`,cn:`有三个要点我们必须记住。`},{en:`This brings me to my next point.`,cn:`这样我就要讲到下一点了。`},{en:`I suppose we could save one or two of the trees, but what’s the point ?`,cn:`我想我们可以拯救一两棵树，不过那有什么意义呢？`},{en:`He is three points behind the leader.`,cn:`他落后领先者三分。`}]},{word:`outgoing`,translation:`adj. 外向的`,phonetic:`'aʊt'goɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`We’re looking for someone with an outgoing personality.`,cn:`我们在找一个性格外向的人。`}]},{word:`better`,translation:`adj. 更好的；较好的; adv. 更好地`,phonetic:`'bɛtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`Your stereo is better than mine.`,cn:`你的音响比我的好。`},{en:`There must be a better way to do this.`,cn:`一定还有更好的办法来做这件事。`},{en:`a better-quality car`,cn:`质量更好的汽车`}]},{word:`loudly`,translation:`adv. 大声地；高声地；花俏地`,phonetic:`'laʊdli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`},{word:`quietly`,translation:`adv. 安静地；悄悄地；平静地`,phonetic:`ˈkwaɪətli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Rosa shut the door quietly.`,cn:`罗莎悄悄关上门。`},{en:`‘I’m sorry,’ she said quietly.`,cn:`“对不起。”她轻声说道。`},{en:`a quietly-spoken man (= one who always speaks quietly )`,cn:`说话轻柔的男人`}]},{word:`hard-working`,translation:`adj. 勤勉的；努力工作的`,phonetic:`ˈhɑːdˈwɜːkɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a hard-working teacher`,cn:`努力工作的老师`}]},{word:`competition`,translation:`n. 竞争；比赛`,phonetic:`,kɑmpə'tɪʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Going to trade fairs is an ideal opportunity to size up the competition .`,cn:`参加商品交易会是估量竞争规模的理想机会。`}]},{word:`fantastic`,translation:`adj. 极好的；了不起的`,phonetic:`fæn'tæstɪk`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`You look fantastic!`,cn:`你看上去棒极了！`},{en:`It’s a fantastic place, really beautiful!`,cn:`这真是个好地方，漂亮极了！`}]},{word:`which`,translation:`pron. 哪一个；哪些`,phonetic:`wɪtʃ`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`We could not reason out which way the robbers escaped, because we were unable to find any trace of them.`,cn:`我们推断不出这些强盗是从哪个方向逃走的，因为我们找不到他们的任何踪迹。`}]},{word:`clearly`,translation:`adv. 清楚地；显然地`,phonetic:`'klɪrli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Please speak clearly.`,cn:`请说得清楚点。`},{en:`The economy was clearly failing.`,cn:`经济很明显在走下坡路。`}]},{word:`win`,translation:`v. 赢；赢得；获胜；获得; n. 胜利`,phonetic:`wɪn`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Who’s winning (= who is most successful at this point in the game )?`,cn:`现在谁领先？`},{en:`The voters gave a narrow win to Vargas Llosa.`,cn:`选民们使瓦尔加斯·略萨取得险胜。`}]},{word:`though`,translation:`conj. 虽然；尽管；; adv. 不过`,phonetic:`ðo`,partOfSpeech:`conj / adv`,examples:[{en:`Though she’s almost 40, she still plans to compete.`,cn:`尽管已经快40岁了，她仍然打算参加比赛。`},{en:`Pascal went ahead with the experiment even though he knew it was dangerous.`,cn:`虽然帕斯卡知道这个试验很危险，但他仍然进行下去。`}]},{word:`talented`,translation:`adj. 有才能的；有天赋的`,phonetic:`'tæləntɪd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a talented actor`,cn:`一名很有天赋的演员`}]},{word:`truly`,translation:`adv. 真实地；真诚地；正确地`,phonetic:`ˈtruːli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`His work is truly original.`,cn:`他的作品确实十分独特。`},{en:`Fawcett was a truly remarkable man.`,cn:`福西特是一位真正不同凡响的人。`},{en:`a truly great work of medieval literature`,cn:`一部真正伟大的中世纪文学作品`},{en:`I am truly sorry.`,cn:`我真的很抱歉。`},{en:`Is it a truly representative sample?`,cn:`这个样本真的具有代表性吗？`}]},{word:`care`,translation:`v. 在乎；关心；担忧；照顾`,phonetic:`kɛr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`‘He looked angry.’ ‘ I don’t care !’`,cn:`“他好像很生气。”“我不管！”`},{en:`She felt that nobody cared.`,cn:`她觉得没有人在乎。`},{en:`He thanked the nurses who had cared for him.`,cn:`他向照料他的护士致谢。`}]},{word:`care about`,translation:`关心`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Share this with anyone you care about.`,cn:`和任何你关心的人分享这些.`},{en:`Those who care about it most will be among the first to call for its renewal and reform.`,cn:`最关心联合国的人将是那些率先要求加强其活力和对它进行改革的人。`}]},{word:`serious`,translation:`adj. 严重的；严肃的；庄重的`,phonetic:`'sɪrɪəs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the serious problem of unemployment`,cn:`严重的失业问题`},{en:`Luckily, the damage was not serious.`,cn:`还好，损坏不算严重。`},{en:`Serious crimes have increased dramatically.`,cn:`重大犯罪案件大幅度增加了。`},{en:`Oil spills pose a serious threat to marine life.`,cn:`原油泄漏对海洋生物构成了严重威胁。`},{en:`The president was in serious trouble .`,cn:`总统遇到大麻烦了。`},{en:`This is a very serious matter .`,cn:`这是件很重要的事情。`}]},{word:`mirror`,translation:`n. 镜子；反映`,phonetic:`'mɪrɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He spends hours in front of the mirror !`,cn:`他老是照镜子！`},{en:`When I looked in the mirror I couldn’t believe it. I looked fantastic!`,cn:`我看着镜子简直不敢相信，我看上去棒极了！`},{en:`We believe the polls are an accurate mirror of public opinion.`,cn:`我们相信民意测验是准确反映公众意见的一面镜子。`}]},{word:`kid`,translation:`n. 孩子，小孩`,phonetic:`kɪd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She’d always loved animals since she was a little kid.`,cn:`她从小就喜爱动物。`},{en:`He’s married with three kids.`,cn:`他已婚，有三个孩子。`},{en:`A neighbor volunteered to keep an eye on the kids (= their children or the children they are responsible for ).`,cn:`一位邻居主动来照看这些小孩。`}]},{word:`as long as`,translation:`只要`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`They can be applied in any context, as long as you understand how to apply them, of course.`,cn:`他们可以在任何一种背景下应用，当然，只要你懂得如何去应用他们。`},{en:`Why, in its presence, should I deny the joy of living, as long as I know everything is not included in this joy?`,cn:`为什么在生活的快乐明明存在时，只要我知道一切都不存在于这种快乐中，我就会否认这种快乐？`},{en:`But he said as long as we remained the only intelligent life in our galaxy and avoided destroying ourselves we should be safe.`,cn:`但是他说只要我们保持在我们的星系中是唯一有智力的生命并且避免破坏我们自己，我们就会安全。`}]},{word:`necessary`,translation:`adj. 必要的；必然的`,phonetic:`ˈnɛsəˌsɛri`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The booklet provides all the necessary information about the college.`,cn:`这本小册子提供了关于那所学院的所有必需信息。`},{en:`No further changes were considered necessary.`,cn:`没有必要作出进一步的改变。`},{en:`The doctor says it may be necessary for me to have an operation.`,cn:`医生说我可能需要做手术。`}]},{word:`be different from`,translation:`和...不同`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`They are new – they can help us make the most of our caring – and that’s why the future can be different from the past.`,cn:`它们在不断更新——它们可以帮助我们让我们的爱心做最多的事情——这就是为什么未来总与过去不同。`},{en:`If you're doing iterative development, what you want to measure in the Elaboration phase will be different from what you measure in the Construction phase.`,cn:`如果你正在做迭代开发，什么是你想在细化阶段测量的将与什么是你想在构建阶段测量的是不同的。`},{en:`When the node is on the same host, the installation directory has to be different from that of the deployment manager, since they are two different product installations.`,cn:`当节点在同一个主机上时，安装目录应该不同于部署管理器的安装目录，这是因为它们是两个不同的产品安装。`}]},{word:`both`,translation:`pron. 两者`,phonetic:`boθ`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`I clasped his hand tight in both of mine.`,cn:`我把他的手紧紧攥在我的两只手里。`}]},{word:`bring out`,translation:`拿出；推出`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`grade`,translation:`n. 成绩`,phonetic:`ɡred`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He got a grade A in maths.`,cn:`他数学得了个A。`},{en:`Tim worked hard and got good grades.`,cn:`蒂姆努力学习，取得了好成绩。`}]},{word:`should`,translation:`aux. 应该；应当；可能；将要`,phonetic:`ʃəd; strong form ʃʊd`,partOfSpeech:`aux`},{word:`the same as`,translation:`与...同样的`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`But I deal with people there, the same as what I should do here.`,cn:`但是在那里我是分管人事工作的，这一点与我将在这里工作一样。`}]},{word:`saying`,translation:`n. 名言`,phonetic:`'seɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`You can’t judge a book by its cover, as the old saying goes.`,cn:`老话说得好，人不可貌相。`}]},{word:`reach`,translation:`v. 到达；伸出；达成；取得联系；延伸；(伸手)去够`,phonetic:`ritʃ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`We reached London late at night.`,cn:`我们深夜到达伦敦`},{en:`She reached into her bag and produced a business card.`,cn:`她伸手从包里取出一张名片。`},{en:`Chelsea could reach the final of the European Cup.`,cn:`切尔西队会进入欧洲杯决赛。`},{en:`中文例句：The talks will continue until a conclusion is reached.`,cn:`会谈将一直进行下去，直到得出结论.`}]},{word:`hand`,translation:`n. 手`,phonetic:`hænd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Steve gripped the steering wheel tightly with both hands.`,cn:`史蒂夫双手紧握方向盘。`},{en:`In her hand was a tattered old photograph.`,cn:`她手中拿着的是一张破旧的老照片。`}]},{word:`touch`,translation:`v. 触摸；感动`,phonetic:`tʌtʃ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She reached out to touch his arm.`,cn:`她伸手去碰他的胳膊。`},{en:`If your house has been burgled, you shouldn’t touch anything until the police arrive.`,cn:`如果家中被盗，在警察赶到之前不要动任何物品。`},{en:`‘Don’t touch me!’ she yelled.`,cn:`“别碰我！”她大叫道。`},{en:`Her plight has touched the hearts of people around the world. 她的困境触动了全世界人的心弦。`,cn:`她的困境触动了全世界人的心弦。`}]},{word:`heart`,translation:`n. 心脏；内心`,phonetic:`hɑrt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Regular exercise is good for the heart.`,cn:`经常锻炼对心脏有好处。`},{en:`Can you hear my heart beating?`,cn:`你能听见我的心跳吗？`},{en:`Her cheeks were hot and her heart was pounding.`,cn:`她脸颊发烫，心怦怦直跳。`},{en:`My heart raced. Were we going to land safely?`,cn:`我心跳得厉害。我们能安全着陆吗？`},{en:`Daniel had no history of heart problems.`,cn:`丹尼尔没有心脏病史。`},{en:`She suffers from a rare heart condition.`,cn:`她患有罕见的心脏病。`},{en:`His breathing and heart rate were now normal.`,cn:`他的呼吸和心率现在都正常了。`},{en:`His heart was full of anger and grief.`,cn:`他的内心充满愤怒和悲伤。`}]},{word:`fact`,translation:`n. 事实；真相；实际`,phonetic:`fækt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Our decision to build the museum in Hartlepool was influenced by the fact that there were no national museums in the North East.`,cn:`我们之所以决定在哈特尔浦建造博物馆，是因为东北地区没有国家级的博物馆。`}]},{word:`in fact`,translation:`事实上；实际上`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I know the mayor really well. In fact, I had dinner with her last week.`,cn:`我跟市长很熟，事实上，我上周还和她一起吃过饭呢。`}]},{word:`break`,translation:`v. 打碎；折断；违背；结束; 打破 (困难或不快的情形)`,phonetic:`brek`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I had to break a window to get into the house.`,cn:`我只得打破一扇窗户进屋。`},{en:`I never break my promises .`,cn:`我从不食言。`},{en:`You betrayed me. You broke your word .`,cn:`你出卖了我，你说话不算数。`},{en:`We need to break the cycle of poverty and crime in the inner cities.`,cn:`我们需要打破旧城区里贫困和犯罪的恶性循环。`}]},{word:`arm`,translation:`n. 胳膊`,phonetic:`ɑrm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Tim’s mother put her arms around him.`,cn:`蒂姆的母亲伸出双臂搂着他。`}]},{word:`laugh`,translation:`v. 发笑；笑; n. 笑声；笑；笑料`,phonetic:`læf`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Maria looked at him and laughed.`,cn:`玛丽亚看着他大笑起来。`},{en:`Tony was laughing so hard he had to steady himself on the table.`,cn:`托尼笑得太厉害了，靠着桌子才能让自己站稳。`},{en:`Nora laughed so much that she nearly cried.`,cn:`诺拉笑得眼泪都快出来了。`},{en:`He couldn’t help it; he burst out laughing (= suddenly started laughing ).`,cn:`他情不自禁地放声大笑起来。`},{en:`He’s one of the few writers who can make me laugh out loud.`,cn:`有几位作家能让我放声大笑，他是其中之一。`}]},{word:`share`,translation:`v. 分享，共享；共有；分配`,phonetic:`ʃɛr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`We don’t have enough books so you’ll have to share.`,cn:`我们书不够，所以你们得合着用。`},{en:`The three of us shared a taxi.`,cn:`我们三个人合乘一辆计程车。`}]},{word:`loud`,translation:`adj. 大声的; adv. 大声地；响亮地`,phonetic:`laʊd`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`Suddenly there was a loud bang.`,cn:`突然砰地一声响`},{en:`Could you speak a little louder?`,cn:`你能不能说得大声点？`},{en:`You’ve got the telly on too loud.`,cn:`你把电视机开得太响了。`}]},{word:`similar`,translation:`adj. 类似的`,phonetic:`'sɪməlɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`We have similar tastes in music.`,cn:`我们对音乐的品位相近。`},{en:`Both approaches seem to achieve similar results.`,cn:`两种方法都得出了相似的结果。`},{en:`A number of his friends had been affected in a similar way .`,cn:`他的一些朋友也受到了类似的影响。`},{en:`The two products look quite similar .`,cn:`这两种产品看上去很相似。`}]},{word:`be similar to`,translation:`类似于；与...相似`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`We also tend to be similar to our friends and family on income and wealth measures.`,cn:`我们在收入和财富衡量标准方面也趋向于我们的朋友和家庭成员。`}]},{word:`primary`,translation:`adj. 小学教育的，初级教育的；原始的；最初的`,phonetic:`'praɪmɛri`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a primary teacher`,cn:`一名小学老师`},{en:`primary education`,cn:`小学教育`},{en:`teaching at primary level`,cn:`小学程度教学`},{en:`a primary tumour`,cn:`早期肿瘤`}]},{word:`primary school`,translation:`n. 小学`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`information`,translation:`n. 信息；情报；资料`,phonetic:`'ɪnfɚ'meʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I need more information.`,cn:`我需要更多信息。`}]},{word:`theater`,translation:`n. 剧场；电影院；戏院`,phonetic:`'θiətɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`comfortable`,translation:`adj. 舒适的；充裕的`,phonetic:`ˈkʌmfɚtəbl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I was so comfortable and warm in bed I didn’t want to get up.`,cn:`床上又舒服又暖和，我都不想起来。`},{en:`Jean’s looking forward to a comfortable retirement.`,cn:`琼盼望着能过上宽裕的退休生活。`}]},{word:`seat`,translation:`n. 座位`,phonetic:`sit`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I was in the back seat and Jo was driving.`,cn:`我在后座，乔开车。`},{en:`a 10,000-seat stadium`,cn:`万人体育场`},{en:`People were shifting in their seats, looking uncomfortable.`,cn:`人们在座位上动来动去，看上去不大自在。`}]},{word:`screen`,translation:`n. 屏幕；银幕`,phonetic:`skrin`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a computer with an 18-inch colour screen`,cn:`带18英寸彩色屏幕的电脑`},{en:`He went on staring at the TV screen .`,cn:`他继续盯着电视屏幕看。`},{en:`He was horrified at some of the images he saw on the screen.`,cn:`从屏幕上看到的一些图像让他感到很恐怖`}]},{word:`close`,translation:`v. 关；合拢；不开放；停业（暂时性或永久性）`,phonetic:`kloz`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Would you mind if I closed the window?`,cn:`我把窗户关上你不介意吧？`},{en:`She closed the curtains.`,cn:`她拉上了窗帘。`},{en:`Let me do the car door – it won’t close properly.`,cn:`我来修一下车门，它关不紧。`},{en:`Beth closed her eyes and tried to sleep.`,cn:`贝丝合上眼睛想睡觉。`},{en:`She heard the door close behind her.`,cn:`她听见门在她身后关上了。`},{en:`The shops close at six.`,cn:`商店6点关门。`}]},{word:`ticket`,translation:`n. 票`,phonetic:`'tɪkɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He had a ticket for a flight on Friday.`,cn:`他有一张星期五的机票。`}]},{word:`worst`,translation:`adj. 最坏的；最差的`,phonetic:`wɝst`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`This is the worst recession for fifty years.`,cn:`这是50年来最严重的一次经济衰退。`},{en:`My worst fear was that we would run out of food.`,cn:`我最大的担忧是我们会把食物吃光。`},{en:`What is the worst possible thing that can happen?`,cn:`最糟可能会发生什么事？`}]},{word:`cheaply`,translation:`adv. 廉价地；`,phonetic:`'tʃi:pli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`When you have your simplified core concept ready, then build that core concept very quickly and cheaply.`,cn:`如果你已经将核心概念简化，那么非常快速并且廉价地构建这一概念。`}]},{word:`song`,translation:`n. 歌曲；歌唱`,phonetic:`sɔŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We used to listen to pop songs on the radio.`,cn:`我们以前常常听收音机里播放的流行歌曲。`},{en:`They sat round with guitars, singing folk songs.`,cn:`他们弹着吉他围坐在一起唱民歌。`},{en:`...dance, music, mime, and song.`,cn:`…舞蹈、音乐、哑剧和歌唱。`}]},{word:`choose`,translation:`v. 选择；决定`,phonetic:`tʃuz`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`It took us ages to choose a new carpet.`,cn:`我们挑选新地毯花了很长时间。`},{en:`A panel of judges will choose the winner.`,cn:`会由一个评判小组选出冠军。`},{en:`He chose his words carefully as he spoke.`,cn:`他说话时字斟句酌。`},{en:`I don’t mind which one we have – you choose.`,cn:`我们要哪一个我无所谓，你来挑吧。`},{en:`You can, if you choose, invest in the stock market.`,cn:`如果你愿意，可以投资股票市场。`}]},{word:`carefully`,translation:`adv. 小心地，认真地`,phonetic:`'kɛrfəli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`He folded the sheets up carefully.`,cn:`他把床单仔细地叠好。`}]},{word:`reporter`,translation:`n. 记者`,phonetic:`rɪ'pɔrtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a news reporter`,cn:`新闻记者`}]},{word:`so far`,translation:`到目前为止；迄今为止`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`fresh`,translation:`adj. 新的；新做的；新增的；新鲜的；清新的`,phonetic:`frɛʃ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I’ll just make some fresh coffee.`,cn:`我来重新煮点咖啡。`},{en:`The report provides fresh evidence about the way the business was run.`,cn:`报告提供了有关该公司运营方式的新证据。`},{en:`You’ll have to start again on a fresh sheet of paper.`,cn:`你得拿张新的纸重新开始。`},{en:`The beans are fresh from the garden.`,cn:`这些豆子是刚从园子里摘来的。`},{en:`a fresh minty taste`,cn:`清新的薄荷味`}]},{word:`comfortably`,translation:`adv. 舒服地；充裕地；容易地`,phonetic:`'kʌmftəbli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`The hotel is modern and comfortably furnished .`,cn:`这家宾馆很现代化，家具很舒适。`},{en:`his comfortably baggy jeans`,cn:`他那宽松舒适的牛仔裤`},{en:`She earns enough money to live comfortably .`,cn:`她赚的钱足够她过得很舒服。`},{en:`the amount of work you can comfortably deal with`,cn:`你可以轻松应付的工作量`}]},{word:`worse`,translation:`adj. 更坏的；更差的`,phonetic:`wɜrs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The traffic is much worse after five o’clock.`,cn:`5点以后交通拥堵严重得多。`},{en:`The weather was a lot worse this year.`,cn:`今年天气糟糕得多。`},{en:`Conditions will get worse as the winter continues.`,cn:`随着冬天持续下去，情况会更糟。`},{en:`High inflation will make unemployment worse.`,cn:`高通货膨胀率将使失业状况更加严重。`},{en:`Don’t say anything, you’ll only make matters worse.`,cn:`什么也别说，说了只会火上浇油。`},{en:`The bullying got worse and worse until finally he had to leave the school.`,cn:`他所受的欺侮越来越过分，最后只得离开了学校。`},{en:`There’s nothing worse than being robbed while you’re on holiday.`,cn:`没有比度假时被抢劫更糟的了。`},{en:`The school’s not perfect, but I suppose it could be worse.`,cn:`这所学校不是十全十美，不过我想还不算太糟吧。`}]},{word:`service`,translation:`n. 公共服务系统，公共服务；公共事业机构`,phonetic:`'sɝvɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the health service`,cn:`医疗保健服务`},{en:`the postal service`,cn:`邮政服务`},{en:`the police service`,cn:`警察部门`},{en:`the prison service`,cn:`监狱系统`},{en:`Workers in the emergency services (= the police, hospital, and the fire service ) are forbidden from striking.`,cn:`紧急服务机构的工作人员是禁止罢工的。`},{en:`There has been a decline in public services in recent years.`,cn:`近年来公共服务减少了。`},{en:`the police, hospitals, fire service, and organizations that provide basic things such as water, gas, or electricity`,cn:`基础服务部门`}]},{word:`pretty`,translation:`adv. 相当地; adj. 漂亮的`,phonetic:`ˈprɪtɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adv / adj`,examples:[{en:`I’m pretty sure he’ll say yes.`,cn:`我相当肯定他会同意的。`},{en:`She still looks pretty miserable.`,cn:`她看上去还是非常痛苦。`}]},{word:`menu`,translation:`n. 菜单`,phonetic:`'mɛnju`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Could we have the menu, please?`,cn:`请把菜单给我们，好吗？`},{en:`a three course set menu`,cn:`三道菜的套餐`}]},{word:`act`,translation:`v. 行动；表演`,phonetic:`ækt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The company acted correctly in sacking him.`,cn:`公司解雇他做得对。`},{en:`The jury decided that Walker had acted in self-defence.`,cn:`陪审团裁定沃克的行为属于自卫。`},{en:`Politicians will only act when enough people demand that they do something.`,cn:`只有足够多的民众起来要求，政客们才会采取行动。`},{en:`She confessed to her parents her desire to act.`,cn:`她向父母承认了她想表演的欲望。`}]},{word:`meal`,translation:`n. 一餐；膳食`,phonetic:`mil`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We must have a meal together some time.`,cn:`我们一定要找个时间一起吃顿饭。`},{en:`Dinner is the main meal of the day for most people.`,cn:`晚饭是大多数人一天中的主餐。`}]},{word:`creative`,translation:`adj. 创造的，创造性的；`,phonetic:`krɪ'etɪv`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`This job is so boring. I wish I could do something more creative.`,cn:`这工作太单调了，我希望能做些更有创造性的事情。`},{en:`I teach creative writing at Trinity College.`,cn:`我在三一学院教创意写作。`},{en:`the creative process of writing a poem`,cn:`写诗的创作过程`},{en:`Diaghilev did his great creative work in France.`,cn:`狄亚格列夫在法国编创了富有创新性的伟大作品。`},{en:`a creative solution to the problem`,cn:`这一问题的创新性解决方法`}]},{word:`performer`,translation:`n. 表演者；执行者`,phonetic:`pɚ'fɔrmɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`circus performers`,cn:`马戏演员`},{en:`He was a better songwriter than performer.`,cn:`他更擅长写歌，而不是演唱。`}]},{word:`talent`,translation:`n. 天赋；才能，才艺；`,phonetic:`'tælənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He has a lot of talent , and his work is fresh and interesting.`,cn:`他很有天赋，作品新颖有趣。`},{en:`a persuasive speaker with a natural talent for leadership`,cn:`有领导天赋、颇有辩才的演说者`},{en:`His latest book reveals hidden talents .`,cn:`他最新的一本书展现了他深藏不露的才能。`},{en:`Sadly, she inherited none of her father’s musical talent .`,cn:`可惜的是，她一点都没有继承她父亲的音乐天赋。`},{en:`Your brother is a man of many talents .`,cn:`你的弟弟是个多才多艺的人。`},{en:`There’s a wealth of talent in English football.`,cn:`英格兰足球界人才济济。`}]},{word:`common`,translation:`adj. 常见的；共同的；普通的`,phonetic:`'kɑmən`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Heart disease is one of the commonest causes of death.`,cn:`心脏病是最常见的死因之一。`},{en:`Moldavians and Romanians share a common language.`,cn:`摩尔达维亚人和罗马尼亚人使用一种共同的语言。`},{en:`Democracy might elevate the common man to a position of political superiority.`,cn:`民主可能会让普通人升至政治上优越的位置。`}]},{word:`have…in common`,translation:`有相同特征`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`magician`,translation:`n. 魔术师；术士`,phonetic:`mə'dʒɪʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`As a magician, his reputation spread all over the world.`,cn:`作为一个魔术师，他的名声传播到了世界各地。`},{en:`Roll up, roll up! See how the magician performs his tricks!`,cn:`快来看，快来看!看看魔术师怎么表演他的魔术!`},{en:`The children's eyes goggled as the magician pulled a rabbit out of the empty hat.`,cn:`当魔术师从空帽子中拉出兔子时，孩子们瞪大眼睛看着。`}]},{word:`all kinds of`,translation:`各种各样；各种类型`,phonetic:`ɔl kaɪndz əv`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`No, blacks have all kinds of jobs.`,cn:`不，黑人从事各种各样的工作。`},{en:`This seemed horrible to me, but I got all kinds of responses.`,cn:`这对我来说很可怕，但我得到了各种各样的反馈。`}]},{word:`beautifully`,translation:`adv. 美丽地；完美地；`,phonetic:`'bju:təfli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`},{word:`be up to`,translation:`是…….的职责；由…….决定`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`role`,translation:`n. 作用；角色`,phonetic:`rol`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Until now scientists had very little clear evidence about the drug's role in preventing more serious effects of infection.`,cn:`到目前为止，科学家们几乎没有该药物在防止更严重的感染后果的功能的明确证据。`},{en:`Matthews plays the role of a young doctor suspected of murder.`,cn:`马修斯扮演一名涉嫌谋杀的年轻医生。`}]},{word:`play a role`,translation:`发挥作用；有影响`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He or she will then show you how all these things, combined, play a role in choosing a career.`,cn:`然后他/她会向你解释如何将这些事情结合起来，在你择业时发挥作用。`},{en:`I think this may be an extraordinary moment in history where Africa can become a continent of hope and the Bank can play a role in that.`,cn:`他说："我认为，这可能是历史上一个不同寻常的时刻，使非洲成为一个希望的大陆，世行可以在这方面发挥作用。`}]},{word:`winner`,translation:`n. 获胜者`,phonetic:`'wɪnɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Five lucky winners will each receive a signed copy of the album.`,cn:`五位幸运的获胜者每人将得到一张签名专辑。`},{en:`As a jockey he rode 10 winners.`,cn:`作为骑师他曾十度驾驭获胜赛马。`}]},{word:`prize`,translation:`n. 奖品；奖金`,phonetic:`praɪz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`In this month’s competition you could win a prize worth £3,000.`,cn:`在本月的竞赛中您可以赢得价值3,000英镑的奖品。`},{en:`The first prize has gone to Dr John Gentle.`,cn:`获得一等奖的是约翰·金特尔博士。`},{en:`The prizes are awarded (= given ) every year to students who have shown original thinking in their work.`,cn:`这些奖项每年颁发给在学习中表现出创造性思维的学生。`},{en:`The total prize money was £30,000.`,cn:`奖金总额为3万英镑。`}]},{word:`everybody`,translation:`pron. 每人；人人`,phonetic:`'ɛvrɪbɑdi`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`The speaker was boring everybody.`,cn:`说话者令每个人生厌。`}]},{word:`make up`,translation:`编造`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I think it's very unkind of you to make up stories about him.`,cn:`我认为你编造关于他的故事是很不友好的。`}]},{word:`example`,translation:`n. 例子；榜样`,phonetic:`ɪg'zæmpl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Can anyone give me an example of a transitive verb?`,cn:`谁能给我举个及物动词的例子吗？`},{en:`Parents should set an example for their children.`,cn:`父母应该为孩子树立榜样。`}]},{word:`for example`,translation:`例如`,phonetic:`fɔr ɪɡˈzæmpəl`,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`poor`,translation:`adj. 贫穷的；可怜的`,phonetic:`pʊər; pʊr`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Her family were so poor they couldn’t afford to buy her new clothes.`,cn:`她家穷得甚至买不起新衣服给她。`},{en:`Poor kid, he’s had a rough day.`,cn:`可怜的孩子，今天他真倒霉。`},{en:`You poor thing , you’ve had a hard time of it, haven’t you?`,cn:`可怜的东西，你过得很苦，是不是？`}]},{word:`seriously`,translation:`adv. 严重地；严肃地`,phonetic:`'sɪrɪəsli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Something was seriously wrong .`,cn:`出大问题了。`},{en:`It’s time we talked seriously about our relationship.`,cn:`我们该认真谈一谈我们的关系了。`}]},{word:`take…seriously`,translation:`认真对待......`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`give`,translation:`v. 给；赠予；送`,phonetic:`ɡɪv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Researchers were given a £10,000 grant to continue their work.`,cn:`研究人员得到一万英镑的经费以继续他们的研究。`},{en:`I’ve got some old diaries that my grandmother gave me years ago.`,cn:`我有几本旧日记本，是多年前祖母给我的。`},{en:`I didn’t steal it! Maria gave it to me!`,cn:`我不是偷的！是玛丽亚给我的！`},{en:`Most people are willing to give to charity .`,cn:`大多数人都愿意向慈善事业捐款。`},{en:`The situation is now desperate, so please give generously .`,cn:`现在情况危急，请大家慷慨解囊。`}]},{word:`crowded`,translation:`adj. 拥挤的`,phonetic:`'kraʊdɪd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a crowded room`,cn:`拥挤的房间`},{en:`a crowded street`,cn:`拥挤的街道`},{en:`The train was very crowded, and we had to stand.`,cn:`火车很挤，我们只好站着。`}]},{word:`sitcom`,translation:`n. 情景喜剧（situation comedy的缩写）`,phonetic:`'sɪtkɑm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Carol was very excited that I was interested in our family's history, even if it was just because a former sitcom actress told me to be.`,cn:`卡萝尔见到我开始对我们家的历史感兴趣，当然非常兴奋。 即使这只是因为我被前情景喜剧里的女演员逼着做的。`},{en:`Examples of this would be a half-hour sitcom, a one-hour drama, an episodic documentary, a how-to program such as cooking or home repair or a reality show.`,cn:`包括半小时的情景喜剧，一小时的剧情片，一部插话式的纪录片，一个诸如烹饪或家居修补或真人秀的指引类节目。`}]},{word:`situation comedy`,translation:`n. 情景喜剧`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The situation comedy is going to start soon, just switch to channel one.`,cn:`情景喜剧马上就要开播了，快调到一频道。`},{en:`Lucy and Desi used a three-camera system on I Love Lucy allowing them to film their show for later broadcast, creating the TV situation comedy as we know it today.`,cn:`露西和德西用三位摄像机系统录制《我爱露西》，这使他们可以将此节目制成电影来播放，这也就诞生了我们今日所熟悉的这部电视喜剧。`},{en:`As a TV program type, situation comedy has been in America for more than 50 years, and it developed well.`,cn:`作为一种电视节目类型，情景喜剧在美国已经有50多年的历史，而且发展成熟。`}]},{word:`news`,translation:`n. 消息；新闻`,phonetic:`nuz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I hope to have some good news for you soon.`,cn:`我希望很快就能给你好消息。`},{en:`a late evening news broadcast`,cn:`晚间新闻节目`}]},{word:`soap`,translation:`n. 肥皂`,phonetic:`sop`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Wash thoroughly with soap and water .`,cn:`用肥皂和水彻底洗一洗。`},{en:`a bar of soap`,cn:`一块肥皂`}]},{word:`soap opera`,translation:`n. 肥皂剧`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They larded many commercials into a ten-minute period before the soap opera.`,cn:`他们在肥皂剧前的十分钟内插播了许多商业广告。`},{en:`After some experience in theater, he landed a role in a soap opera and dropped out of high school just shy of graduation.`,cn:`在取得一些舞台剧演出经验之后，他获得一个肥皂剧的角色，于是没有等到高中毕业就辍学了。`}]},{word:`educational`,translation:`adj. 教育的；有教育意义的`,phonetic:`,ɛdʒu'keʃənl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the educational development of children`,cn:`儿童的教育发展`},{en:`educational games`,cn:`寓教于乐的游戏`}]},{word:`plan`,translation:`n. 计划; v. 打算；计划`,phonetic:`plæn`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`His plan is to get a degree in economics and then work abroad for a year.`,cn:`他计划先取得经济学学位，然后去国外工作一年。`},{en:`Do you have any plans for the weekend?`,cn:`你周末有什么打算？`},{en:`There’s been a change of plan – we’re not going to Ibiza after all.`,cn:`计划有变，我们终究还是不去伊维萨岛了。`},{en:`If you plan what you're going to eat, you reduce your chances of overeating.`,cn:`如果你对要吃的东西加以计划，饮食过度的几率就会减少。`}]},{word:`hope`,translation:`v. 希望；期望；盼望; n. 希望`,phonetic:`hop`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`I do hope everything goes well.`,cn:`我真心希望一切顺利。`},{en:`It was hoped that the job would be filled by a local person.`,cn:`希望该职位由当地人来担任。`},{en:`Let’s just hope someone finds her bag.`,cn:`希望有人找到她的提包。`},{en:`I hope to God I haven’t left the car window open.`,cn:`但愿我没有忘记关车窗。`},{en:`中文例句：When I first arrived in New York, I was full of hope for the future.`,cn:`我初到纽约时，对未来充满希望。`}]},{word:`find out`,translation:`查明、弄清`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`It makes you want to watch the next episode to find out what's going to happen.`,cn:`这使你想看下一集，以弄清接下来要发生什么。`},{en:`I was relieved to find out that my problems were due to a genuine disorder.`,cn:`查明我的问题的确是失调造成的，我就放心了。`}]},{word:`discussion`,translation:`n. 讨论；谈论`,phonetic:`dɪ'skʌʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`class discussions`,cn:`课堂讨论`},{en:`the topics suggested for discussion`,cn:`建议讨论的话题`},{en:`We have had discussions about her legal situation.`,cn:`我们就她的法律状况已进行了讨论。`}]},{word:`stand`,translation:`v. 站立；忍受`,phonetic:`stænd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`It looks like we’ll have to stand – there are no seats left.`,cn:`看来我们只能站着——没有座位了。`},{en:`She stood in the doorway.`,cn:`她站在门口。`},{en:`Stand still(= do not move ) and listen to me.`,cn:`站好别动，听我说。`},{en:`Don’t just stand there (= stand and not do anything ) – help me!`,cn:`不要光站在那里，帮帮我！`}]},{word:`happen`,translation:`v. 发生；碰巧`,phonetic:`'hæpən`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`When did the accident happen?`,cn:`事故什么时候发生的？`},{en:`It’s impossible to predict what will happen next.`,cn:`不可能预测接下来会发生什么。`},{en:`She carried on as if nothing had happened.`,cn:`她继续干，似乎什么都未曾发生。`},{en:`This was bound to happen sooner or later.`,cn:`这事注定早晚会发生。`},{en:`This kind of thing happens all the time.`,cn:`这种事一直在发生。`},{en:`We’ll still be friends, whatever happens.`,cn:`不管发生什么，我们仍然是朋友。`},{en:`I happened to see James in town.`,cn:`我碰巧在镇上遇见詹姆斯。`}]},{word:`may`,translation:`modal. 可能，也许；可以，能够`,phonetic:`me`,partOfSpeech:`modal`,examples:[{en:`I may be late, so don’t wait for me.`,cn:`我可能会迟到，所以别等我。`},{en:`Mr. Hobbs? May we come in?`,cn:`霍布斯先生？我们可以进去吗？`}]},{word:`expect`,translation:`v. 预期；期待；盼望`,phonetic:`ɪk'spɛkt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`He will be hard to beat. I fully expect (= am completely sure about ) that and I’m ready.`,cn:`他很难击败。我确信这一点，不过我准备好了。`},{en:`‘Who are you?’ he murmured, only half expecting (= thinking it was possible, but not likely ) her to answer.`,cn:`“你是谁？”他低声问道，预计她可能不会回答。`},{en:`He didn’t get his expected pay rise.`,cn:`他没有得到他预想的加薪。`},{en:`He wasn't expecting our hospitality.`,cn:`他没有期待我们的热情款待。`}]},{word:`joke`,translation:`n. 笑话；玩笑; v. 说笑话；开玩笑`,phonetic:`dʒok`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`I couldn’t go out with someone for a joke, could you?`,cn:`我可不能拿谈恋爱当儿戏，对不对？`}]},{word:`comedy`,translation:`n. 喜剧`,phonetic:`'kɑmədi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a career in stand-up comedy`,cn:`单口喜剧表演职业`}]},{word:`meaningless`,translation:`adj. 无意义的；不重要的`,phonetic:`'minɪŋləs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`He said a few meaningless words to his hostess and looked around the room.`,cn:`他向女主人说了几句无关紧要的话，又环视了一下房间。`},{en:`a repetitive and meaningless task`,cn:`重复且无意义的工作`}]},{word:`action`,translation:`n. 行动；行为`,phonetic:`'ækʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The government must take action (=  do something  ) now to stop the rise in violent crime.`,cn:`政府现在必须采取行动遏止暴力犯罪的上升。`},{en:`She was looking forward to putting her ideas into action (=  doing the things she had planned  ) .`,cn:`她盼望着将自己的想法付诸实施。`},{en:`Ambulance crews are ready to spring into action (=  suddenly start doing something  ) if anything goes wrong during the race.`,cn:`救护车急救人员随时准备出动，以应对比赛期间发生的意外。`},{en:`The child could not be held responsible for his actions (= he was too young to be blamed for them ) .`,cn:`不能要求这个小孩对自己的行为负责。`}]},{word:`action movie`,translation:`n. 动作片`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There was an old action movie next.`,cn:`接下来演的是一部老动作片。`},{en:`Instead of going to see an action movie, take action in your own life.`,cn:`与其看动作片，不如花点心思在你的生活上。`}]},{word:`cartoon`,translation:`n. 卡通；漫画`,phonetic:`kɑr'tun`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`cartoon characters such as Donald Duck`,cn:`唐老鸭一类的卡通人物`}]},{word:`culture`,translation:`n. 文化`,phonetic:`'kʌltʃɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We speak Danish at home so that the boys don’t lose touch with their language and culture.`,cn:`我们在家说丹麦语，这样男孩子们就不会脱离他们的语言和文化。`},{en:`In our culture, it is rude to ask someone how much they earn.`,cn:`在我们的文化里，问别人收入多少是不礼貌的。`},{en:`I love working abroad and meeting people from diffe-rent cultures.`,cn:`我喜欢在国外工作，认识来自不同文化的人。`}]},{word:`famous`,translation:`adj. 著名的；有名的`,phonetic:`'feməs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a famous actor`,cn:`著名演员`},{en:`Many famous people have stayed in the hotel.`,cn:`许多名人都曾下榻这家酒店。`},{en:`The Eiffel Tower is a famous landmark (= a famous place or building that is easy to recognize ) .`,cn:`埃菲尔铁塔是著名的地标。`},{en:`Da Vinci’s world-famous portrait of the Mona Lisa`,cn:`达•芬奇的那幅闻名世界的肖像画《蒙娜丽莎》`}]},{word:`appear`,translation:`v. 似乎；显得；出现`,phonetic:`ə'pɪr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Police have found what appear to be human remains.`,cn:`警方发现了疑似人体遗骸的东西。`},{en:`He tried hard to appear calm .`,cn:`他努力让自己显得镇静。`},{en:`I don’t want to appear rude.`,cn:`我不想显得无礼。`},{en:`The right colours can make a small room appear much bigger.`,cn:`颜色运用恰当可以使小房间显得大很多。`},{en:`Two faces appeared at our window.`,cn:`两张面孔出现在我们的窗口。`}]},{word:`become`,translation:`v. 变成；成为`,phonetic:`bɪ'kʌm`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The weather became warmer.`,cn:`天气变暖和了。`},{en:`Slowly my eyes became accustomed to the darkness.`,cn:`我的眼睛渐渐适应了黑暗。`},{en:`Helen became increasingly anxious about her husband’s strange behaviour.`,cn:`海伦越来越担心她丈夫的反常行为。`},{en:`Pollution from cars has become a major problem.`,cn:`汽车污染已成为严重的问题。`}]},{word:`rich`,translation:`adj. 富有的；富饶的；丰富的`,phonetic:`rɪtʃ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`one of the richest women in America`,cn:`美国最富有的女人之一`},{en:`Rich mineral deposits have been found in the sea bed.`,cn:`海底发现有丰富的矿床。`},{en:`Red meat is a rich source of iron.`,cn:`红肉含有大量铁质。`}]},{word:`successful`,translation:`adj. 成功的；圆满的`,phonetic:`sək'sɛsfl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The operation was successful.`,cn:`手术成功了。`},{en:`a highly successful (= very successful ) meeting`,cn:`十分成功的会议`}]},{word:`might`,translation:`modal. 可能；也许；may的过去式`,phonetic:`maɪt`,partOfSpeech:`modal`,examples:[{en:`I might be a few minutes late.`,cn:`我可能会晚到几分钟。`}]},{word:`main`,translation:`adj. 主要的；最重要的`,phonetic:`meɪn`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The main reason for living in Spain is the weather.`,cn:`居住在西班牙的主要原因是天气。`},{en:`What do you consider to be the main problem?`,cn:`你认为最主要的问题是什么？`},{en:`Our main concern is that the children are safe.`,cn:`我们最关心的是保证孩子们的安全。`},{en:`a summary of the main points of the agreement`,cn:`协议要点的总结`},{en:`the main aim of the meeting`,cn:`会议的要旨`},{en:`I’ll meet you outside the main entrance.`,cn:`我在大门外等你。`},{en:`the main bedroom`,cn:`主卧室`}]},{word:`reason`,translation:`n. 原因；理由`,phonetic:`ˈrizən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She has reason to feel guilty.`,cn:`她有理由感到内疚。`}]},{word:`comedy`,translation:`n. 喜剧`,phonetic:`'kɑmədi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a career in stand-up comedy`,cn:`单口喜剧表演职业`}]},{word:`film`,translation:`n. 电影`,phonetic:`fɪlm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Have you seen any good films recently?`,cn:`你最近看过什么好的影片吗？`}]},{word:`unlucky`,translation:`adj. 倒霉的；不幸的；不吉利的`,phonetic:`ʌn'lʌki`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Thierry Henry was desperately unlucky not to score when his shot hit the post.`,cn:`蒂埃里·亨利太不走运了，射门没进，球打中了门柱。`},{en:`Some people think black cats are unlucky.`,cn:`有些人认为黑猫不吉利。`}]},{word:`lose`,translation:`v. 丢失；失败`,phonetic:`luz`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I’ve lost my appetite.`,cn:`我已经没有了胃口。`},{en:`Try not to lose heart (= become sad and hopeless ) - there are plenty of other jobs.`,cn:`不要灰心―还有很多其他的工作。`},{en:`By the time the ambulance arrived, Douglas had lost consciousness .`,cn:`救护车赶到时，道格拉斯已经失去知觉。`},{en:`They played so badly they deserved to lose.`,cn:`他们打得这么差，输了活该。`}]},{word:`girlfriend`,translation:`n. 女朋友`,phonetic:`'ɡɝlfrɛnd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He’s never had a girlfriend.`,cn:`他从来没有交过女朋友。`},{en:`one of my ex-girlfriends`,cn:`我的一个前女友`},{en:`I didn’t have a steady girlfriend (= one you have a long relationship with ) .`,cn:`我那时没有固定的女友。`}]},{word:`ready`,translation:`adj. 准备好的；乐意的`,phonetic:`'rɛdi`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Come on. Aren’t you ready yet?`,cn:`快点，你还没准备好吗？`},{en:`When the doorbell rang he was ready and waiting .`,cn:`门铃响的时候，他已经准备好在等着了。`},{en:`Why does it take you so long to get ready to go out?`,cn:`你外出怎么要准备那么长时间？`},{en:`They were ready to die for their beliefs.`,cn:`他们愿意为信仰而献身。`}]},{word:`be ready to`,translation:`愿意做某事`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`character`,translation:`n. 个性；品质；人物`,phonetic:`'kærɪktɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He has a cheerful but quiet character.`,cn:`他的性格乐观文静。`},{en:`Children grow up with a mixture of character traits (= character qualities ) from both sides of their family.`,cn:`儿童在成长过程中会把父母亲双方的性格特点都继承下来。`},{en:`his temper and other character flaws`,cn:`他的火爆脾气和其他性格缺陷`},{en:`Candida is the most interesting character in the play.`,cn:`坎迪达是剧中最有趣的人物。`}]},{word:`simple`,translation:`adj. 简单的；朴素的；单纯的`,phonetic:`'sɪmpl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a simple but effective solution to the problem`,cn:`对这个问题简单而有效的解决办法`},{en:`There is no simple answer to this question.`,cn:`这个问题没有简单的答案。`},{en:`I’m sure there’s a perfectly simple explanation.`,cn:`我相信一定有一个很简单的解释。`},{en:`We want to keep the costumes as simple as possible.`,cn:`我们想使服装尽量简单。`},{en:`We can’t pay people any more money until the company is more profitable. I’m afraid it’s as simple as that .`,cn:`只有公司赢利更多，我们才能支付更高的报酬。 恐怕就这么简单。`},{en:`She dressed with simple elegance.`,cn:`她的穿着朴素而优雅。`},{en:`Completing the race is not just a simple matter of physical fitness.`,cn:`跑完比赛不仅仅是纯粹的体力问题。`}]},{word:`dress up`,translation:`装扮；乔装打扮`,phonetic:`drɛs ʌp`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`You do not need to dress up for dinner.`,cn:`你不必为了晚宴盛装打扮。`},{en:`I just love the fun of dressing up in another era's clothing.`,cn:`我就是喜欢穿另一个时代的服装，很好玩。`}]},{word:`take sb.’s place`,translation:`代替；替换`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`army`,translation:`n. 军队；陆军；一大批`,phonetic:`'ɑrmi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The army are helping to clear up after the floods.`,cn:`陆军部队正协助洪灾后的清理工作。`},{en:`an army officer`,cn:`陆军军官`},{en:`Army units launched attacks on bases near Jounieh port.`,cn:`陆军部队对朱尼耶港附近的基地发动了进攻。`},{en:`He joined the army when he was 17.`,cn:`他17岁参加了陆军。`},{en:`The village hall is maintained by an army of volunteers .`,cn:`村礼堂由一大批志愿者维护。`}]},{word:`do a good job`,translation:`工作干得好；做得好`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`If you do a good job, you may tell yourself that it wasn’t good enough or that anyone could have done as well.`,cn:`比如你完成了一项出色的工作，你或许告诉你自己它不够好，任何人都可以做的像你一样好。`}]},{word:`grow up`,translation:`长大；成长`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`She grew up in Tokyo.`,cn:`她在东京长大。`}]},{word:`computer programmer`,translation:`n. 计算机管理员`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`What is the best part of being a computer programmer?`,cn:`成为一名计算机程序员最好的部分是什么？`},{en:`What are some qualifications of a computer programmer?`,cn:`什么是计算机程序员应具备的条件？`},{en:`The computer programmer botched (up) the job and had to start over.`,cn:`计算机程序设计员把文件弄坏了，只好重做。`}]},{word:`cook`,translation:`v. 烹调，煮，烧，做(饭)`,phonetic:`kʊk`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Where did you learn to cook?`,cn:`你在哪里学烹调的？`},{en:`Cook the sauce over a low heat for ten minutes.`,cn:`把这调味汁用低火烧十分钟。`},{en:`slices of cooked ham`,cn:`熟的火腿片`},{en:`a cooked breakfast`,cn:`做好的早餐`}]},{word:`doctor`,translation:`n. 医生`,phonetic:`'dɑktɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She was treated by her local doctor.`,cn:`她由她的本区医生治疗。`},{en:`I’d like to make an appointment to see Dr Pugh.`,cn:`我想预约看皮尤医生。`}]},{word:`engineer`,translation:`n. 工程师`,phonetic:`,ɛndʒɪ'nɪr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He trained as a civil engineer (= one who designs and builds roads, bridges etc ).`,cn:`他接受过土木工程师培训。`}]},{word:`violinist`,translation:`n. 小提琴手`,phonetic:`,vaɪə'lɪnɪst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`His mother tagged him along, hurried but the kid stopped to look at the violinist.`,cn:`妈妈拉着他急匆匆地走，但他停下来注视着小提琴家。`},{en:`Sir Edward Elgar (1857-1934) is known for his choral and orchestral works, some of which have been made more widely known by the famous violinist Yehudi Menuhin.`,cn:`爱德华·艾尔加爵士 (1857-1934)因合唱和管弦乐曲目而知名，其中一些作品因著名的小提琴家耶胡迪·梅纽因而更广为人知。`},{en:`Guitarist Django Reinhardt and violinist Stephen Grapelli are the most famous gypsy jazz artists and they both happen to play for this quintet.`,cn:`吉他手莱因哈特和小提琴家斯蒂芬·格拉佩利是最著名的吉普赛爵士乐艺术家，他们都曾为法国爱乐五重奏演出。`}]},{word:`driver`,translation:`n. 驾驶员；驱动程序`,phonetic:`'draɪvɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a taxi driver`,cn:`出租车司机`},{en:`Do you think you’re a good driver?`,cn:`你认为自己是个好司机吗？`},{en:`The driver got out of his van.`,cn:`司机从货车里下来。`}]},{word:`pilot`,translation:`n. 飞行员`,phonetic:`'paɪlət`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`an airline pilot`,cn:`航空公司飞行员`},{en:`a fighter pilot`,cn:`战斗机驾驶员`},{en:`The official report into the accident says that it was caused by pilot error (= a mistake by the pilot ) .`,cn:`那宗事故的官方报告称事故是由飞行员失误造成的。`}]},{word:`pianist`,translation:`n. 钢琴家`,phonetic:`'pɪənɪst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They fashioned him into a fine pianist.`,cn:`他们把他培养成一个优秀的钢琴家。`},{en:`He is now being  coached by a famous pianist.`,cn:`他现在正由一位著名的钢琴家进行辅导。`},{en:`The pianist was irked because the audience's coughing drowned out his playing.`,cn:`这名钢琴演奏者很厌烦，因为听众的咳嗽声盖过了他的演奏。`}]},{word:`scientist`,translation:`n. 科学家`,phonetic:`'saɪəntɪst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He is a scientist of high prestige.`,cn:`他是一位有声望的科学家。`},{en:`As a scientist,he disbelieves in Jesus.`,cn:`作为一名科学家，他不信耶稣。`},{en:`The scientist thirsts after an achievement.`,cn:`这名科学家渴望取得成就。`}]},{word:`be sure about`,translation:`确信`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`That is scary, and we cannot be sure about changes in the future.`,cn:`这是可怕的，因为我们无法确定未来会发生什么变化。`},{en:`There were many I didn't know, and others I couldn't be sure about because they were all covered in green parasites.`,cn:`这里有许多我不认识的树，还有有一些树我没法确认，因为它们都覆盖在了密密麻麻的绿色藤蔓植物下。`},{en:`However, you need to be sure about no reuse.`,cn:`但是，需要确保没有重用。`}]},{word:`make sure`,translation:`确保`,phonetic:`mek ʃʊər`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I make sure they work well.`,cn:`我要确认他们做得很好。`},{en:`And you have to make sure, what I always say.`,cn:`所以我经常说，你要确保良好的工作环境。`},{en:`Then, make sure that you and your spouse share these goals with each other.`,cn:`尽可能具体地说，就是确保你和你的配偶彼此共享这些目标。`}]},{word:`college`,translation:`n. 大学`,phonetic:`'kɑlɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a teacher training college`,cn:`师范学院`},{en:`Donna left school and went to art college.`,cn:`唐娜中学毕业后进了艺术学院。`}]},{word:`education`,translation:`n. 教育`,phonetic:`,ɛdʒu'keʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She also hopes her children will get a good education.`,cn:`她也希望她的孩子可以受到良好的教育。`},{en:`efforts to improve girls’ access to education`,cn:`为增加女孩受教育机会所作的努力`}]},{word:`medicine`,translation:`n. 药；医学`,phonetic:`ˈmedɪsn; mɛdəsn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Medicines should be kept out of the reach of children.`,cn:`药应放在孩子够不到的地方。`},{en:`Have you been taking your medicine ?`,cn:`你一直在服药吗？`},{en:`a medicine bottle`,cn:`药瓶`},{en:`She studied medicine at Johns Hopkins University.`,cn:`她曾在约翰•霍普金斯大学学医。`}]},{word:`university`,translation:`n. 大学，高等学府`,phonetic:`,junɪ'vɝsəti`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She buddied up with a student from another university.`,cn:`她与来自另一大学的一名学生交朋友。`},{en:`The student left the university to go out into the world and find himself.`,cn:`这个学生离开了大学进入社会去发现自己的才能所在。`}]},{word:`article`,translation:`n. 文章，论文`,phonetic:`'ɑrtɪkl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The paper’s leading article (=  the main article  ) described the government as weak.`,cn:`该报社论称政府软弱。`},{en:`newspaper articles`,cn:`报纸上的文章`}]},{word:`send`,translation:`v. 邮寄，发送`,phonetic:`sɛnd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Lyn sent some pictures of the wedding.`,cn:`琳恩寄了几张婚礼照片。`}]},{word:`resolution`,translation:`n. 决定；决心`,phonetic:`,rɛzə'luʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a resolution calling for a ban on dumping nuclear waste`,cn:`要求禁止倾倒核废物的决议`},{en:`They have failed to comply with the resolution.`,cn:`他们没有遵守决议。`},{en:`Carol made a resolution to work harder at school.`,cn:`卡萝尔下决心要更用功地学习。`}]},{word:`team`,translation:`n. (一)队(人)；(一)组(人)`,phonetic:`tim`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Which team do you support?`,cn:`你支持哪个队？`},{en:`Our team are winning.`,cn:`现在是我们队赢。`}]},{word:`foreign`,translation:`adj. 外国的`,phonetic:`'fɔrən`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`foreign students`,cn:`外国学生`},{en:`Can you speak any foreign languages?`,cn:`你会讲外语吗？`},{en:`the success of foreign companies in various industries`,cn:`外国公司在各行业的成功`},{en:`I thought she sounded foreign.`,cn:`我觉得她说话像外国人。`},{en:`transactions in foreign currencies`,cn:`外汇买卖`}]},{word:`able`,translation:`adj. 聪明能干的，能力出众的`,phonetic:`'ebl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`one of my more able students`,cn:`我班上能力比较强的学生之一`}]},{word:`be able to`,translation:`能够做某事`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I’ve always wanted to be able to speak Japanese.`,cn:`我一直想学会讲日语。`}]},{word:`question`,translation:`n. 问题`,phonetic:`'kwɛstʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Can I ask you a question?`,cn:`我能问你个问题吗？`},{en:`I’m afraid I can’t answer that question.`,cn:`我恐怕无法回答那个问题。`}]},{word:`meaning`,translation:`n. 意义`,phonetic:`'minɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`What’s the meaning of this? I asked you to be here an hour ago!`,cn:`这是什么意思？我让你一小时之前就要到的！`}]},{word:`discuss`,translation:`v. 讨论，商量`,phonetic:`dɪ'skʌs`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Littman refused to discuss the case publicly.`,cn:`利特曼拒绝公开讨论此案。`},{en:`If you would like to discuss the matter further, please call me.`,cn:`如果你想进一步讨论此事，请打电话给我。`}]},{word:`promise`,translation:`v. 承诺，诺言; n. 诺言`,phonetic:`'prɑmɪs`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`The post office has promised to resume first class mail delivery to the area on Friday.`,cn:`邮局已承诺在星期五恢复该地区第一类邮件的递送。`},{en:`He had promised that the rich and privileged would no longer get preferential treatment.`,cn:`他已承诺富人和特权阶层将不会再得到优待。`},{en:`Promise me you will not waste your time.`,cn:`向我承诺你不会浪费你的时间。`},{en:`I'll call you back, I promise.`,cn:`我会给你回电话的，我保证。`},{en:`If you make a promise, you should keep it.`,cn:`如果你许下一个诺言，你就应该遵守它。`}]},{word:`beginning`,translation:`n. 开头，开端`,phonetic:`bɪ'ɡɪnɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There’s a short poem at the beginning of every chapter.`,cn:`每一章的开头都有一首短诗。`},{en:`From the beginning of my career as a journalist, I’ve been writing about gender issues.`,cn:`从我一开始干记者这一行，我就写性别议题的题材。`},{en:`I thought he loved me; perhaps he did in the beginning .`,cn:`我以为他爱我，也许开始时他确实是爱我的。`},{en:`That chance meeting marked the beginning of a long and happy relationship.`,cn:`那次邂逅展开了一段长久而幸福的关系。`},{en:`This is just the beginning of a new and different life for you.`,cn:`这只是你新的别样生活的开始。`},{en:`I said he would cause trouble, right from the beginning .`,cn:`我一开始就说过，他会惹事。`},{en:`I opposed it from the very beginning .`,cn:`我一开始就反对。`},{en:`The whole trip was a disaster from beginning to end .`,cn:`旅途从头到尾都在出乱子。`},{en:`I feel like I’ve been offered a new beginning .`,cn:`我感觉好像有了一个重新开始的机会。`},{en:`Could we start at the beginning ? Tell me where you first met him.`,cn:`我们从头讲起好吗？告诉我，你是在哪里认识他的？`}]},{word:`at the beginning of`,translation:`起初`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`improve`,translation:`改进，改善`,phonetic:`ɪm'pruv`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`a course for students wishing to improve their English`,cn:`为想提高英语水平的学生开设的一门课`},{en:`The doctors say she is improving (= after being ill ).`,cn:`医生说她正在康复。`},{en:`You could use the money for improving your home.`,cn:`你可以用这笔钱改善家居。`},{en:`Many wines improve with age (= get better as they get older ).`,cn:`很多葡萄酒年代越久越香醇。`}]},{word:`write down`,translation:`写下`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`On the morning before starting a diet, write down your starting weight.`,cn:`早上开始节食前，记下你的起始体重。`}]},{word:`physical`,translation:`adj. 身体的`,phonetic:`'fɪzɪkl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`She was in constant physical pain.`,cn:`她一直感到身上疼痛。`},{en:`the physical and emotional needs of young adults`,cn:`青年人的身心需求`},{en:`people with severe physical disabilities`,cn:`身体重度残疾的人`},{en:`Don’t be put off by his physical appearance .`,cn:`别因为他的外貌讨厌他。`},{en:`He was obsessed with physical fitness .`,cn:`他对健身着了迷。`}]},{word:`themselves`,translation:`pron. 他们自己`,phonetic:`ðɛm'sɛlvz`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Teachers have no choice but to take measures to protect themselves.`,cn:`教师们别无选择，只能采取措施来保护自己。`},{en:`Our neighbours have just bought themselves a jacuzzi.`,cn:`我们邻居刚刚买了一个按摩浴缸。`},{en:`The kids seem very pleased with themselves.`,cn:`那些孩子好像自得其乐。`}]},{word:`have to do with`,translation:`关于;与……有关系`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`What does that have to do with you?`,cn:`那与您有什么关系吗？`},{en:`So what does all this have to do with etymology?`,cn:`那么这一切与词源有什么关系呢？`}]},{word:`self-improvement`,translation:`n. 自我改进，自我提高`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`take up`,translation:`学着做；开始做`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He did not particularly want to take up a competitive sport.`,cn:`他并没有特别想要开始从事竞技性运动项目。`}]},{word:`hobby`,translation:`n. 业余爱好`,phonetic:`'hɑbi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`What are your hobbies?`,cn:`你有些什么爱好？`},{en:`Susan’s hobbies include reading, cooking, and drama.`,cn:`苏珊的业余爱好包括阅读、烹饪和戏剧。`},{en:`Retirement gave him the time to pursue his hobbies.`,cn:`退休以后他有充裕的时间来做自己喜欢做的事。`}]},{word:`weekly`,translation:`adj. 每周的; n. 周刊; adv. 每周一次；逐周`,phonetic:`'wikli`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n / adv`,examples:[{en:`a weekly current affairs programme`,cn:`一周一档的时事节目`},{en:`twice-weekly flights`,cn:`每周两次的航班`},{en:`The group meets weekly.`,cn:`小组每周见面一次。`},{en:`a popular news weekly`,cn:`受欢迎的新闻周刊`}]},{word:`school work`,translation:`n. 学校作业`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He is in charge of the school work.`,cn:`他负责学校工作。`},{en:`If you have kids, then you can’t help but have some clutter with toys and school work.`,cn:`如果你有孩子，那么你只能成天徘徊于堆积如山的玩具和学校的事情中。`},{en:`The big demand is for teachers-turned-nannies, who can help the kids with increasingly demanding school work.`,cn:`做过老师的保姆需求量很大，她们可以帮助孩子完成要求越来越高的学校作业。`}]},{word:`agree`,translation:`v. 同意；赞成`,phonetic:`ə'ɡri`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Teenagers and their parents rarely agree.`,cn:`十几岁的孩子跟父母意见很少一致。`},{en:`I suggested we go somewhere for the weekend and she agreed at once.`,cn:`我提议我们去某个地方度周末，她立即表示赞同`}]},{word:`agree with`,translation:`同意`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`She nodded to agree with me.`,cn:`她点头同意了我的意见。`},{en:`I do not agree with him.`,cn:`我不同意他的看法。`},{en:`I myself agree with you, but I can't speak for my boss.`,cn:`我同意你的提议，可我的话并不能代表我的老板。`}]},{word:`own`,translation:`pron. 自己的，本人的; v. 拥有`,phonetic:`on`,partOfSpeech:`pron / v`,examples:[{en:`Bring your own equipment.`,cn:`带上你自己的装备。`},{en:`Every dance has its own rhythm.`,cn:`每一种舞蹈都有自己的节奏。`},{en:`The yacht was intended for the King’s own personal use.`,cn:`这艘游艇是专供国王私用的。`},{en:`His face was only a few inches from her own.`,cn:`他的脸离她自己的脸非常近。`},{en:`The building is owned by the local council.`,cn:`这幢大楼归地方议会所有。`}]},{word:`personal`,translation:`adj. 个人的，私人的`,phonetic:`'pɝsənl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`My personal view is that we shouldn’t offer him the job.`,cn:`我个人认为我们不该给他这份工作。`},{en:`Style and colour are a matter of personal taste .`,cn:`款式和颜色是个人爱好问题。`},{en:`She took full personal responsibility for all the arrangements.`,cn:`她个人对所有的安排承担全部责任。`},{en:`When I went to her room all her personal belongings had gone.`,cn:`我到她房间时，她所有的私人物品都已不在了。`},{en:`After Alan’s death, his mother received his personal effects .`,cn:`艾伦死后，他母亲接收了他的私人物品。`},{en:`I know from personal experience that you can’t trust Ralph.`,cn:`根据我的亲身经验，我认为你不能相信拉尔夫。`},{en:`the personal qualities needed to be successful in business`,cn:`生意成功所需要的个人素质`},{en:`The car is for personal use only.`,cn:`这辆汽车仅供私人使用。`},{en:`On a personal level he felt sympathy for them, but he had a job to do.`,cn:`从个人角度他很同情他们，但是他有任务在身。`},{en:`celebrities with their own personal trainer`,cn:`拥有私人健身教练的名流`}]},{word:`relationship`,translation:`n. 关系`,phonetic:`rɪ'leʃən'ʃɪp`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`A good relationship is built on trust.`,cn:`一种好的关系是以信任为基础的。`},{en:`His relationship with Mary went through four stages.`,cn:`他与玛丽的关系经历了四个阶段。`},{en:`Their first exchange set the tone for a new relationship.`,cn:`他们初步交换意见， 为建立新关系定了调子。`}]},{word:`paper`,translation:`n. 纸`,phonetic:`'pepɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I’ll get you a piece of paper so you can write the number down.`,cn:`我给你找张纸，你好把号码写下来。`},{en:`Do you have a pen and paper?`,cn:`你有笔和纸吗？`}]},{word:`pollution`,translation:`n. 污染；污染物`,phonetic:`pə'luʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`California’s tough anti-pollution laws`,cn:`加利福尼亚州严厉的反污染法`},{en:`a plan to reduce pollution`,cn:`减少污染物的计划`}]},{word:`prediction`,translation:`n. 预测`,phonetic:`prɪ'dɪkʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The data can be used to make useful economic predictions .`,cn:`这些数据可用于进行有用的经济预测。`}]},{word:`future`,translation:`n. 未来`,phonetic:`ˈfjutʃɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We are now more able to predict future patterns of climate change.`,cn:`我们现在更有能力预测未来气候的变化模式了。`},{en:`We’ve been able to save this land from development and preserve it for future generations .`,cn:`我们保全了这块土地，没有去开发，而是把它留给子孙后代。`},{en:`the debate over the future development of the European Union`,cn:`关于欧盟未来发展的辩论`}]},{word:`pollute`,translation:`v. 污染`,phonetic:`pə'lut`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`beaches polluted by raw sewage`,cn:`受未经处理的污水污染的海滩`},{en:`The factory pollutes the air and water.`,cn:`那家工厂污染了空气和水。`}]},{word:`environment`,translation:`n. 环境`,phonetic:`ɪn'vaɪrənmənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Some of these chemicals are very damaging to the environment.`,cn:`这些化学品中有些对环境非常有害。`},{en:`legislation to protect the environment`,cn:`保护环境的法规`},{en:`the effects of acid rain on the environment`,cn:`酸雨对环境的影响`},{en:`the government minister for the environment`,cn:`负责环境事务的政府部长`}]},{word:`planet`,translation:`n. 行星`,phonetic:`'plænɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The picture shows six of the nine planets in the solar system.`,cn:`这张图片展示太阳系9个行星中的6个行星。`}]},{word:`earth`,translation:`n. 地球；泥土`,phonetic:`ɝθ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the planet Earth`,cn:`地球`},{en:`footprints in the wet earth`,cn:`中文例句:湿土中的脚印`}]},{word:`plant`,translation:`n. 植物; v. 种植`,phonetic:`plænt`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`Don’t forget to water the plants.`,cn:`别忘记给植物浇水。`},{en:`Residents have helped us plant trees.`,cn:`居民们帮助我们种了树。`}]},{word:`part`,translation:`n. 部分；参加`,phonetic:`pɑrt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`For part of the day, you will be outside doing practical work.`,cn:`你们每天将有一部分时间在户外实际操作。`},{en:`If only he could conceal his part in the accident.`,cn:`如果他能掩盖他在那次事故中有份参与就好了。`}]},{word:`play a part`,translation:`参与（某事）`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`peace`,translation:`n. 和平`,phonetic:`pis`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The country is at peace with its neighbours for the first time in years.`,cn:`这是多年来该国与其邻国第一次和平共处。`},{en:`By the end of the century, France had made peace with Britain.`,cn:`到那个世纪末，法国和英国议和了。`},{en:`a city where people of different religions have lived together in peace for centuries`,cn:`不同宗教的人们和平共处数百年的城市`},{en:`efforts to bring peace to the region`,cn:`为该地区争取和平的努力`},{en:`a dangerous situation which threatens world peace`,cn:`威胁世界和平的危险状况`},{en:`An uneasy peace continued until 1939.`,cn:`不稳定的和平局面维持到1939年。`},{en:`the Northern Ireland peace talks`,cn:`北爱尔兰和平会谈`},{en:`an international peace conference`,cn:`国际和平大会`},{en:`the peace treaty that ended the First World War`,cn:`终结第一次世界大战的和平条约`},{en:`the Middle East peace process`,cn:`中东和平进程`}]},{word:`sea`,translation:`n. 海；海洋；；许多；大量（与of连用）`,phonetic:`si`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Jay stripped his clothes off and ran into the sea.`,cn:`杰伊脱光衣服奔入海里。`},{en:`Most exports went by sea .`,cn:`大部分出口商品都走海路。`},{en:`a little cottage by the sea`,cn:`一座海滨小屋`},{en:`He spent over 30 years at sea .`,cn:`他在船上工作了30多年。`},{en:`They stood side by side looking out to sea .`,cn:`他们并排站着眺望大海。`},{en:`He looked out at the sea of faces.`,cn:`他放眼望去，人海茫茫。`}]},{word:`sky`,translation:`n. 天空`,phonetic:`skaɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The sky grew dark, and a cold rain began to fall.`,cn:`天色转暗，开始下起冰冷的雨来。`},{en:`A shooting star sped across the sky.`,cn:`一颗流星划过天空。`}]},{word:`astronaut`,translation:`n. 宇航员`,phonetic:`'æstrəˌnɔt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`So why become an astronaut at all?`,cn:`那么，为什么要成为一名宇航员呢？`},{en:`Yes, I have wanted to be an astronaut.`,cn:`是的，我想过成为一个宇航员。`},{en:`Many different qualities go towards the making of an astronaut.`,cn:`一名宇航员必须具备许多不同的素质。`}]},{word:`apartment`,translation:`n. 公寓`,phonetic:`ə'pɑrtmənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She lives in a small apartment.`,cn:`她住在一套小公寓里。`}]},{word:`rocket`,translation:`n. 火箭；`,phonetic:`'rɑkɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The rocket was launched from a space research base.`,cn:`火箭从一个太空研究基地发射升空。`},{en:`a space rocket`,cn:`航天火箭`}]},{word:`space`,translation:`n. 空间；太空`,phonetic:`spes`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`How much space is there on each disk?`,cn:`每张磁盘有多大容量？`},{en:`The hedge takes up too much space .`,cn:`这树篱占了太多的地方。`},{en:`creatures from outer space`,cn:`来自外太空的生物`}]},{word:`space station`,translation:`n. 太空站`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`human`,translation:`adj. 人的; n. 人；人类`,phonetic:`'hjumən`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n`,examples:[{en:`There are many different cell types in the human body .`,cn:`人体中有许多种不同的细胞类型。`},{en:`the power of the human mind`,cn:`人脑的威力`},{en:`The desire for joy lies deep within the human spirit .`,cn:`对快乐的渴求藏在人类心灵深处。`},{en:`Infra-red light is invisible to the human eye .`,cn:`红外线是人眼看不见的。`},{en:`theories of human behaviour`,cn:`关于人类行为的理论`},{en:`different areas of human experience`,cn:`人类各方面的经验`},{en:`respect for the absolute value of human life`,cn:`对人类生命绝对价值的尊重`},{en:`The accident was the result of human error .`,cn:`事故是由于人为过失造成的。`},{en:`The meat was declared unfit for human consumption .`,cn:`这种肉被宣布不适合人类食用。`},{en:`Like humans, cats and dogs are omnivores.`,cn:`和人类一样，猫和狗是杂食性动物。`}]},{word:`servant`,translation:`n. 仆人`,phonetic:`'sɝvənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Many young girls became domestic servants .`,cn:`许多年轻姑娘成了家仆。`}]},{word:`dangerous`,translation:`adj. 危险的`,phonetic:`'dendʒərəs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`laws about dangerous dogs`,cn:`有关危险犬类的法律`},{en:`Some of these prisoners are extremely dangerous.`,cn:`这些囚犯中有些极为危险。`},{en:`The powdered milk was not as good as breast milk, and was downright dangerous (= actually dangerous ) when it was mixed with unclean water.`,cn:`奶粉没有母乳好，用不洁净的水冲调更会造成危险。`}]},{word:`already`,translation:`adv. 已经`,phonetic:`ɔl'rɛdi`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`The design of the new house is similar to those that have already been built.`,cn:`新房的设计与那些已建好的房子相似。`},{en:`The performance had already started when we arrived.`,cn:`我们到达时表演已经开始了。`}]},{word:`factory`,translation:`n. 工厂`,phonetic:`'fæktri`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a car factory`,cn:`汽车制造厂`},{en:`factory workers`,cn:`工厂工人`}]},{word:`over and over again`,translation:`多次；反复地`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`believe`,translation:`v. 相信`,phonetic:`bɪ'liv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`You shouldn’t believe everything you read.`,cn:`你不应尽信书上看来的东西。`},{en:`I believed him, even though his story sounded unlikely.`,cn:`我相信了他，尽管他的话听上去难以置信。`},{en:`I don’t believe a word of it (=  I think it is completely untrue  ) .`,cn:`我一句话也不相信。`}]},{word:`disagree`,translation:`v. 不同意`,phonetic:`,dɪsə'ɡri`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Barr strongly disagreed with Kronfeld’s statement.`,cn:`巴尔强烈反对克龙费尔德的说法。`}]},{word:`even`,translation:`adv. 甚至；愈加`,phonetic:`'ivən`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Most companies have suffered a drop in their profits, even very large companies.`,cn:`大多数公司的利润都出现下滑，甚至连很大的公司也不例外。`},{en:`It was quite difficult to see, even with the light on.`,cn:`这很难看得见，即使开着灯也没有用。`},{en:`He became quite successful and even appeared on a television show once.`,cn:`他相当成功，甚至还上了一次电视节目。`},{en:`She did not even bother to phone us.`,cn:`她甚至连电话都没打给我们。`},{en:`He never even acknowledged my letter.`,cn:`他收到我的信甚至从不会告知一声。`},{en:`This will make our job even more difficult.`,cn:`这会使我们的工作难上加难。`}]},{word:`hundreds of`,translation:`许多 ；大量； 成百上千`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`shape`,translation:`n. 形状`,phonetic:`ʃep`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`What shape is the table?`,cn:`那张桌子是什么形状的？`},{en:`You can recognize a tree by the shape of its leaves.`,cn:`可以根据树叶的形状辨认出是什么树。`},{en:`His battered old hat had completely lost its shape.`,cn:`他那顶破旧的帽子已经完全变形了。`},{en:`The plants grow in every shape and size .`,cn:`这些植物有各种形状，各种大小。`},{en:`The children cut out shapes (= squares, triangles etc ) from the piece of cardboard.`,cn:`孩子们把卡纸片剪成各种形状。`}]},{word:`fall`,translation:`v. 摔倒；跌倒`,phonetic:`fɔl`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I fell and hit my head.`,cn:`我跌了一跤，撞到了头。`},{en:`Peter was playing by the river when he fell in (= fell into the water ) .`,cn:`彼得在河边玩着玩着，掉进了水里。`}]},{word:`fall down`,translation:`突然倒下；跌倒；倒塌`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`inside`,translation:`n. 里面；内部；内脏; adj. 里面的；内部的；秘密的；内幕的; adv. 在里面; prep. 在……之内`,phonetic:`'ɪn'saɪd`,partOfSpeech:`n / adj / adv / prep`,examples:[{en:`The door had been locked from the inside.`,cn:`门从里面锁上了。`},{en:`The jewels were locked away inside the safe.`,cn:`珠宝锁入了保险箱。`},{en:`A full report is expected inside three months.`,cn:`完整的报告要在三个月内完成。`}]},{word:`look for`,translation:`寻找；寻求`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`"What should I look for"?`,cn:`是要我寻找什么吗？`},{en:`" so we can look for those features.`,cn:`这样我们就可以寻找那些特征。`}]},{word:`possible`,translation:`可能的`,phonetic:`'pɑsəbl`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Is it possible toget tickets for the game?`,cn:`有没有可能弄到比赛的门票？`},{en:`It might be possible for the documents to be sent over.`,cn:`这些文件也许可以发送过去。`},{en:`Computer technology makes it possible for many people to work from home.`,cn:`计算机技术让许多人可以在家里工作。`},{en:`I want to avoid the rush hour traffic if possible .`,cn:`如有可能我想避开交通高峰时间。`},{en:`I walk or use public transport whenever possible .`,cn:`只要有可能我就步行或者乘坐公共交通工具。`},{en:`We are doing everything possible to track down the killer.`,cn:`我们正竭尽全力追捕杀人凶手。`},{en:`Our staff will help you in every way possible .`,cn:`我们的员工会尽力帮助你。`},{en:`Even if it were technically possible , we do not have the money to do it.`,cn:`即使技术上可行，我们也没有钱去做。`},{en:`She decided to stay as far away from him as was humanly possible .`,cn:`她决定尽可能离他远点。`}]},{word:`impossible`,translation:`adj. 不可能的；不可能存在的；难以忍受的；难以忍受的; n. 不可能；不可能的事`,phonetic:`ɪm'pɑsəbl`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n`,examples:[{en:`‘I want to speak to Mr Franks.’ ‘I’m afraid that’s impossible.’`,cn:`“我想和弗兰克斯先生谈谈。”“恐怕不行。”`},{en:`It’s impossible to be accurate about these things.`,cn:`这些事情不可能准确无误。`},{en:`The noise made sleep impossible.`,cn:`噪音吵得人无法睡觉。`},{en:`Members with young children often found it impossible to attend evening meetings.`,cn:`有小孩的会员常觉得没法参加晚上的聚会。`},{en:`It is difficult to find work these days, but for blind people it is virtually impossible.`,cn:`现在找工作很难，对于盲人来说几乎是不可能。`},{en:`He was faced with a seemingly impossible task.`,cn:`他面临着似乎不可能完成的任务。`},{en:`It was physically impossible to get the fridge through the door.`,cn:`根本不可能把冰箱从这扇门搬过去。`},{en:`Six months ago, peace seemed an impossible dream.`,cn:`六个月前和平还似乎是个无法实现的梦。`},{en:`Such mental attitudes are difficult, if not impossible, to change.`,cn:`即使有可能，要改变这样的心态也是很难的。`},{en:`The woman is impossible, thought Francesca.`,cn:`弗朗西丝卡暗自思忖，这个女人真让人受不了。`},{en:`I just want to be able to buy healthy food at a reasonable price. Is that asking the impossible?`,cn:`我只是希望能以合理的价格买到健康食品。难道这是在要求不可能的事吗？`}]},{word:`side`,translation:`n. 侧面；旁边；方面; v. 支持；同意，支持; adj. 旁的，侧的`,phonetic:`saɪd`,partOfSpeech:`n / v / adj`,examples:[{en:`Fuel is cheaper on the French side of the border.`,cn:`燃料在边境那边的法国要便宜些。`},{en:`A man stood watching me from the other side of the road.`,cn:`有个男人站在马路的对面看着我。`},{en:`His friends and family were all on the other side of the world.`,cn:`他的朋友和家人都在地球的另一边。`},{en:`The restaurant was empty apart from another couple on the far side of the room (= the area that is furthest away from you ) .`,cn:`饭店里空空的，只有最那边还有一对夫妇。`},{en:`He is in charge of the civilian side of the UN mission.`,cn:`他在联合国使团中负责平民方面的事务。`},{en:`Frank sided with David against their mother.`,cn:`弗兰克站在戴维一边反对妈妈。`},{en:`Hannah slipped out through a side exit.`,cn:`汉娜从一个侧门溜了出去。`}]},{word:`probably`,translation:`adv. 大概；或许；很可能`,phonetic:`'prɑbəbli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`The White House probably won't make this plan public until July.`,cn:`白宫可能要到7月份才会公布这项计划。`},{en:`Van Gogh is probably the best-known painter in the world.`,cn:`梵高可能是世界上最知名的画家。`}]},{word:`during`,translation:`prep. 在……的时候，在……的期间`,phonetic:`'dʊrɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`During the summer she worked as a lifeguard.`,cn:`夏天她当过救生员。`},{en:`He slept calmly during the early part of the night.`,cn:`他上半夜睡得很安稳。`},{en:`Foxes remain hidden during the day.`,cn:`狐狸白天一直躲藏着。`}]},{word:`holiday`,translation:`n. 假日`,phonetic:`'hɑləde`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The school holidays start tomorrow.`,cn:`学校假期从明天开始。`}]},{word:`word`,translation:`n. 字；词；单词`,phonetic:`wɝd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Write an essay of about five hundred words.`,cn:`写一篇约500字的文章。`},{en:`What does that word mean?`,cn:`那个单词是什么意思？`},{en:`‘Vater’ is the German word for (= that means ) ‘father’.`,cn:`vater在德语中是“父亲”的意思。`},{en:`Perhaps ‘lucky’ is not exactly the right word .`,cn:`也许“幸运”一词还不够贴切。`}]},{word:`shake`,translation:`v. 摇动；震动；动摇；发抖; n. 摇动；哆嗦`,phonetic:`ʃek`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`She shook him to wake him up.`,cn:`她摇摇他，想把他叫醒。`},{en:`Shake the bottle before you open it.`,cn:`打开瓶子之前先摇一摇。`},{en:`The whole house started to shake.`,cn:`整幢房子摇晃起来。`},{en:`The car shook as it went over a bump.`,cn:`汽车驶过一个隆起的地方时颠了一下。`},{en:`The little boy’s hand was shaking.`,cn:`这小男孩的手在发抖。`},{en:`Give the bottle a good shake before use.`,cn:`使用前要用力摇晃瓶子`},{en:`His confidence was badly shaken.`,cn:`他的自信心受到很大的打击。`}]},{word:`milk shake`,translation:`n. 奶昔（牛奶和冰淇淋等的混合饮料）`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`This milk shake is a 32oz meal which infuses you with an entire day’s calorie and almost two day’s fat allowance in one drink, 2310 calories and 108g saturated fat.`,cn:`一份32盎司的奶昔包含了你身体一整天所需要的卡路里和几乎两天的所需要的脂肪量-2310的卡路里和108克的饱和脂肪。`},{en:`They conclude that a daily dose of statins would compensate for a daily cheeseburger and a small milk shake.`,cn:`他们得出结论，一剂普通的他汀类药物可以抵消一个普通汉堡和一个小奶昔增加的心脏病发作增加的风险。`}]},{word:`blender`,translation:`n. 搅拌器；果汁机`,phonetic:`'blɛndɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Puree cucumber in a blender.`,cn:`用搅拌机打成黄瓜泥。`},{en:`They're easy to grind in a blender or coffee grinder. But get seeds -- there are no lignans in the oil.`,cn:`他们在搅拌机或咖啡豆的磨具很容易被磨碎，但种子如果榨成油木酚素就被破坏了。`},{en:`Just toss a cup of berries — strawberries, blueberries, raspberries — and a sliced (but not peeled) apple, peach, or pear into your blender.`,cn:`把一杯莓子——草莓、蓝莓、山莓，还有一片没削皮的苹果、桃、或梨子放入你的搅拌机。`}]},{word:`turn on`,translation:`打开`,phonetic:`tɝ​n ɑn`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I want to turn on the television.`,cn:`我想打开电视机。`}]},{word:`peel`,translation:`v. 削皮；剥落`,phonetic:`pil`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Peel and dice the potatoes.`,cn:`把马铃薯去皮并切成丁。`},{en:`New skin grows, and the damaged skin peels off.`,cn:`新皮肤长出，受损的皮肤脱落。`}]},{word:`pour`,translation:`v. 倒；倾倒`,phonetic:`pɔr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She poured coffee for everyone.`,cn:`她为每个人都倒了咖啡。`}]},{word:`yogurt`,translation:`n. 酸奶；`,phonetic:`'joɡət`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`If you like cottage cheese, add some fruit and/or yogurt!`,cn:`如果你喜欢农家鲜干酪，那就加些水果和酸奶吧！`},{en:`It can be store-bought plain yogurt or the last spoonfuls of your most recent homemade batch.`,cn:`它可以使商店中没来的纯酸奶，或者是最后一勺你最近一批自制的酸奶。`}]},{word:`honey`,translation:`n. 蜂蜜`,phonetic:`'hʌni`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Where did you buy the honey?`,cn:`你在哪里买到这蜂蜜的？`},{en:`Do you like honey?`,cn:`你喜欢吃蜂蜜吗？`}]},{word:`watermelon`,translation:`n. 西瓜`,phonetic:`'wɔtɚmɛlən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Oh, what a big watermelon!`,cn:`喔唷， 这么大的西瓜!`},{en:`The pulp of this watermelon is too spongy.`,cn:`这西瓜瓤儿太肉了。`},{en:`This kind of watermelon is remarkable for its size.`,cn:`这种西瓜个头儿大。`}]},{word:`spoon`,translation:`n. 勺，调羹`,phonetic:`spun`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He stirred his coffee with a spoon.`,cn:`他用匙搅了搅咖啡。`}]},{word:`pot`,translation:`n. 壶；盆；罐; v. 把……装罐`,phonetic:`pɑt`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`herbs growing in pots`,cn:`长在花盆里的草本植物`},{en:`Pot the cuttings individually.`,cn:`将这些剪枝一个个的装盆。`}]},{word:`add`,translation:`v. 增加`,phonetic:`æd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`If the mixture seems dry, add water.`,cn:`如果混合物看上去干，加点水。`}]},{word:`finally`,translation:`adv. 最后，最终`,phonetic:`'faɪnlɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`After several delays we finally took off at six o’clock.`,cn:`几经耽搁后，我们终于在六点起飞了。`},{en:`Finally, Karpov cracked under the pressure.`,cn:`最后，卡尔波夫承受不住压力崩溃了。`}]},{word:`salt`,translation:`n. 盐`,phonetic:`sɔlt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`This might need some salt and pepper.`,cn:`这里面也许要加点盐和胡椒粉。`},{en:`a pinch of salt`,cn:`一撮盐`},{en:`Could you pass the salt?`,cn:`递一下盐好吗？`}]},{word:`sugar`,translation:`n. 糖`,phonetic:`'ʃʊgɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Do you take sugar in your coffee?`,cn:`你的咖啡加糖吗？`}]},{word:`cheese`,translation:`n. 干酪，奶酪`,phonetic:`tʃiz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`half a kilo of cheese`,cn:`半公斤干酪`},{en:`a cheese sandwich`,cn:`干酪三明治`},{en:`Sprinkle with the grated cheese.`,cn:`撒上磨碎的干酪。`},{en:`a selection of English cheeses`,cn:`精选英国干酪`}]},{word:`popcorn`,translation:`n. 爆米花`,phonetic:`'pɑpkɔrn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I have the popcorn!`,cn:`我有爆米花。`},{en:`Once you believe, then it’s on and popping like popcorn.`,cn:`一旦你相信，它就会像爆米花一样“砰”地弹出来。`}]},{word:`corn`,translation:`n. 谷物；玉米`,phonetic:`kɔrn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`fields of corn`,cn:`一片片麦田`},{en:`an ear of corn`,cn:`谷穗`},{en:`All our chickens are fed on corn.`,cn:`我们所有的鸡都喂玉米。`}]},{word:`machine`,translation:`n. 机器`,phonetic:`mə'ʃin`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Could you get me a coffee from the drinks machine ?`,cn:`给我从自动饮料机里买一罐咖啡好吗？`},{en:`The fax machine is broken.`,cn:`传真机坏了。`},{en:`Did you put my dirty shirts in the machine (= washing machine ) ?`,cn:`你把我的脏衬衫放进洗衣机里了吗？`},{en:`I left a message for you on your machine (= telephone answering machine ) .`,cn:`我在你的电话答录机里留了言。`},{en:`The machine wouldn’t let me have any money (= cash machine ) .`,cn:`自动取款机不让我取钱。`}]},{word:`dig`,translation:`v. 挖，掘；探究; n. 挖苦；刺；戳`,phonetic:`dɪɡ`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`freshly dug carrots`,cn:`刚挖出来的胡萝卜`},{en:`He has been digging into the local archives.`,cn:`他一直在仔细研究当地的档案。`},{en:`She couldn't resist a dig at Dave after his unfortunate performance.`,cn:`戴夫演出失败之后，她忍不住给了他一顿嘲弄。`},{en:`Cassandra silenced him with a sharp dig in the small of the back.`,cn:`卡桑德拉在他腰背上狠狠地戳了一下让他闭上了嘴。`}]},{word:`hole`,translation:`n. 洞，孔；洞穴，穴; v. （高尔夫球等）进洞 凿洞`,phonetic:`hol`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`I began digging a hole for the plant.`,cn:`我开始挖洞种那棵植物。`},{en:`He holed the putt with ease.`,cn:`他轻松地推球入洞。`}]},{word:`sandwich`,translation:`n. 三明治`,phonetic:`'sænwɪtʃ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a ham sandwich`,cn:`火腿三明治`}]},{word:`butter`,translation:`n. 黄油，奶油`,phonetic:`'bʌtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The farmer churned the cream to butter.`,cn:`这个农民把奶油搅拌成黄油。`}]},{word:`turkey`,translation:`n. 火鸡`,phonetic:`'tɝki`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They simply demolished the turkey.`,cn:`他们全吃光了那只火鸡。`},{en:`I knew then that we would have no turkey or ham for Christmas and I felt sad.`,cn:`我知道在我们的圣诞节餐桌上肯定不会有火鸡或火腿，我感到难过。`}]},{word:`lettuce`,translation:`n. 莴苣，生菜`,phonetic:`'lɛtɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`One potential test of public acceptance could come with the marketing of irradiated spinach and lettuce.`,cn:`一个民众接受程度的可能性测试将与辐照菠菜和莴苣的上市销售同步进行。`},{en:`If you've suffered anxiety, headaches, or muscle or joint pain, you might already be familiar with wild lettuce.`,cn:`如果你曾经遭受过焦虑、头痛、肌肉或关节疼痛的症状，你也许已经熟悉了野莴苣。`},{en:`So why does it feel like even the lettuce is out to get us?`,cn:`那么为什么感觉甚至连莴苣都要加害我们呢？`}]},{word:`piece`,translation:`n. 件；篇；片；块；`,phonetic:`pis`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Cut off a piece of wood 5 cm in length.`,cn:`截下一段五厘米长的木头。`},{en:`His trousers were held up with a piece of string.`,cn:`他的裤子靠一根细绳系着。`},{en:`Would you like a small or a large piece?`,cn:`你想要一小块还是一大块？`},{en:`Chop the potato into bite-sized pieces.`,cn:`把马铃薯切成小块。`}]},{word:`Thanksgiving`,translation:`n. 感恩节`,phonetic:`'θæŋks,ɡiviŋ; ,θæŋks'ɡ-`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`That we all have Thanksgiving dinner together?`,cn:`我们会一起用感恩节晚餐吗？`},{en:`As she puts it, “We do see each other for Thanksgiving and some meals.`,cn:`如她所解释的那样，“我们在感恩节和一些餐会上见面”。`},{en:`Such treaties begin with, but soon go far beyond, the jolly exchange of pie at Thanksgiving for cake on birthdays.`,cn:`这样的协议一开始，就广泛的流传开来，为了生日时的蛋糕在感恩节交换派的快乐。`}]},{word:`traditional`,translation:`adj. 传统的`,phonetic:`trə'dɪʃənl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`traditional Italian cooking`,cn:`传统的意大利烹饪`},{en:`a traditional Irish folk song`,cn:`传统的爱尔兰民歌`},{en:`a traditional method of brewing beer`,cn:`传统的啤酒酿造方法`}]},{word:`autumn`,translation:`n. 秋天; adj. 秋天的，秋季的`,phonetic:`'ɔtəm`,partOfSpeech:`n / adj`,examples:[{en:`He was elected judge in the autumn of 1991.`,cn:`他于1991年秋被选为法官。`},{en:`autumn mists`,cn:`秋天的雾霭`}]},{word:`traveler`,translation:`n. 旅行者`,phonetic:`'trævlɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The message is the traveler, moving from one specific airport to another specific airport.`,cn:`消息是这个旅行者，要从一个特定的机场到另一个特定的机场。`},{en:`By thus sweeping over centuries and minds, by miming man as he can be and as he is, the actor has much in common with that other absurd individual, the traveler.`,cn:`就这样，演员不知经历了多少世纪，横跨过多少心智，模仿着他们的所能与所是，渐渐的，他和那个荒谬的个体，那个旅行者，有了许多共同之处。`}]},{word:`celebrate`,translation:`v. 庆祝；庆贺`,phonetic:`sɛləˌbret`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`It’s Dad’s birthday and we’re going out for a meal to celebrate.`,cn:`今天是爸爸的生日，我们打算出去吃饭庆祝一下。`},{en:`My folks are celebrating their 50th anniversary.`,cn:`我父母正在庆祝他们结婚50周年。`},{en:`We hope to give fans something to celebrate this season.`,cn:`我们希望在本赛季能给球迷一些值得庆祝的事。`}]},{word:`mix`,translation:`v. 混淆；使混和；配制; n. 混合；混合物；混乱`,phonetic:`mɪks`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Oil and water don’t mix.`,cn:`油和水不相融。`},{en:`Will you mix us some martinis, Bill?`,cn:`给我们调几杯马丁尼酒好吗，比尔？`}]},{word:`pepper`,translation:`n. 胡椒粉；椒类`,phonetic:`'pɛpɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`salt and pepper`,cn:`盐和胡椒粉`},{en:`...2 red or green peppers, sliced.`,cn:`…2个切成片了的红椒或青椒。`}]},{word:`fill`,translation:`v. 装满，使充满；满足；任职`,phonetic:`fɪl`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`He poured her a drink, then filled his own glass.`,cn:`他给她倒了一杯，然后将自己的杯子斟满。`},{en:`My job was filling the flour sacks.`,cn:`我的工作是装面粉袋。`},{en:`Take a deep breath and allow your lungs to fill.`,cn:`深吸一口气，让肺部涨满。`},{en:`There was just enough wind to fill the sails.`,cn:`正好有足够大的风鼓满船帆。`},{en:`Miller’s band was filling dance halls (= attracting a lot of people ) all over the country.`,cn:`米勒的乐队在全国各地的舞厅都人气爆棚。`},{en:`Volunteers fill a real need for teachers in the Somali Republic.`,cn:`志愿者满足了索马里共和国对教师的迫切需求。`},{en:`Women fill 35% of senior management positions.`,cn:`女性担任35%的高级管理职位。`}]},{word:`oven`,translation:`n. 烤箱；烤炉`,phonetic:`ˈʌvən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Preheat the oven to 200 degrees C.`,cn:`把烤箱预热至200摄氏度。`},{en:`Press the mixture onto the bread and bake in a hot oven for ten minutes.`,cn:`把混合料抹在面包上，然后在烤箱内高温烘烤10分钟。`}]},{word:`plate`,translation:`n. 碟；金属牌；金属板; v. 镀上（金或银）`,phonetic:`pleɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`The plates were piled high with rice.`,cn:`盘子里都堆满了米饭。`},{en:`The brass plate on the door said ‘Dr Rackman’.`,cn:`黄铜门牌上写着“雷克曼博士”。`},{en:`copper printing plates`,cn:`铜印版`},{en:`a beautiful necklace, plated with 22-carat gold`,cn:`一条漂亮的22开镀金项链`}]},{word:`cover`,translation:`v. 遮盖，盖`,phonetic:`'kʌvɚ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Cover the pot and bake for an hour.`,cn:`把锅盖上，烘烤一小时。`},{en:`She wore a low-cut dress, partly covered by a thin shawl.`,cn:`她穿了件低胸连衣裙，搭了一条薄薄的披肩。`}]},{word:`gravy`,translation:`n. 肉汁；肉汤`,phonetic:`'ɡrevi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Can't you call it gravy?`,cn:`你不能叫这种东西肉汁吧？`},{en:`You have spilled gravy on the tablecloth.`,cn:`你把肉汁泼到台布上了。`},{en:`They will even pour gravy on your sandwiches if you let them.`,cn:`如果你愿意的话，他们甚至会给你的三明治浇上肉汁。`}]},{word:`serve`,translation:`n. 接待，服务`,phonetic:`sɝv`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There was only one girl serving customers .`,cn:`只有一个女孩在接待顾客。`}]},{word:`temperature`,translation:`n. 温度，气候`,phonetic:`ˈtempərtʃʊər; tɛmpɚ-ˌtʃʊr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The temperature of the water was just right for swimming.`,cn:`这水温游泳正好。`},{en:`Water boils at a temperature of 100˚C.`,cn:`水在100摄氏度沸腾。`}]},{word:`prepare`,translation:`v. 预备；准备`,phonetic:`prɪ'pɛr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The prosecution wanted more time to prepare their case.`,cn:`原告想要有更多的时间来准备诉讼。`}]},{word:`prepare for`,translation:`为……准备`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`We have to be careful about injuries but we have to prepare for that game.`,cn:`我们必须要小心伤病，但是我们也必须要为比赛做准备。`}]},{word:`exam`,translation:`n. 考试`,phonetic:`ɪg'zæm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`At the end of each level, there’s an exam.`,cn:`在每一级别结束时都有一次考试。`},{en:`How did you do in your exams?`,cn:`你考试考得怎么样？`}]},{word:`flu`,translation:`n. 流感`,phonetic:`flu`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Steven’s still in bed with flu .`,cn:`史蒂文患了流感，仍卧病在床。`},{en:`She’s got the flu .`,cn:`她得了流感。`},{en:`I couldn’t go because I had flu .`,cn:`我得了流感，去不了。`},{en:`Doctors now fear a flu epidemic .`,cn:`医生现在担心会出现流感大爆发。`}]},{word:`available`,translation:`adj. 可得到的；有空的`,phonetic:`ə'veləbl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Tickets are available from the box office.`,cn:`售票处有票出售。`},{en:`Meetings were held to update employees as soon as new information became available .`,cn:`一有新的信息就开会告诉员工。`},{en:`Further building can continue when money is made available .`,cn:`有了资金就可以继续进一步的施工。`},{en:`Every available space on the wall was covered in pictures.`,cn:`墙上每一个可用的地方都挂上了画。`},{en:`Collins was not available for comment on Thursday night.`,cn:`柯林斯星期四晚上没空发表评论。`}]},{word:`another time`,translation:`其他时间，别的时间`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`until`,translation:`conj. 在…之前；直到…时; prep. 在…之前；到…为止`,phonetic:`ən'tɪl`,partOfSpeech:`conj / prep`,examples:[{en:`The ticket is valid until March.`,cn:`这张票的有效期一直到 3 月份。`},{en:`He waited until she had finished speaking.`,cn:`他一直等到她讲完。`},{en:`Until recently, Anna worked as a teacher in Japan.`,cn:`直到最近，安娜一直在日本当老师。`},{en:`Up until last year, they didn’t even own a car.`,cn:`一直到去年，他们连汽车也没有。`}]},{word:`hang`,translation:`悬挂`,phonetic:`hæŋ`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Philip hung his coat on a hook behind the door.`,cn:`菲利普把自己的大衣挂在门后的钩子上。`},{en:`She hung the sheets on the washing line.`,cn:`她把床单晾在晒衣绳上。`}]},{word:`hang out`,translation:`常去某处；泡在某处`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`catch`,translation:`抓住；捕捉`,phonetic:`kætʃ`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He was caught red-handed (= as he was doing something wrong ) taking money from the cash register.`,cn:`他从现金出纳机偷钱时被当场抓住。`}]},{word:`invite`,translation:`v. 邀请`,phonetic:`ɪn'vaɪt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I’m afraid I wasn’t invited.`,cn:`恐怕我没有受到邀请。`}]},{word:`accept`,translation:`v. 接受；`,phonetic:`əkˈsɛpt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Rick accepted her offer of coffee.`,cn:`她请里克喝咖啡，他接受了。`},{en:`He accepted the invitation to stay with us.`,cn:`他接受了邀请来我们家住。`},{en:`His school reports said that he is always ready to accept a challenge (=  agree to do something difficult  ) .`,cn:`他的学业报告上说他乐于接受挑战。`},{en:`Please accept this small gift.`,cn:`请收下这份小小的礼物。`},{en:`They offered me a job and I accepted.`,cn:`他们给我一份工作，我接受了。`},{en:`He readily accepted her invitation (=  accepted it quickly  ) .`,cn:`他欣然接受了她的邀请。`}]},{word:`refuse`,translation:`v. 拒绝`,phonetic:`ri'fjʊz`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She asked him to leave, but he refused.`,cn:`她叫他走，但他不肯。`},{en:`When he offered all that money, I could hardly refuse (= could not refuse ) , could I?`,cn:`他愿意给那么多钱，我怎么可能拒绝呢？`}]},{word:`the day before yesterday`,translation:`前天`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`This note to the bank matured the day before yesterday.`,cn:`这张银行票据前天到期了。`},{en:`And she has fasted ever since the day before yesterday's walk, from sorrow and rage that I dispatched her out of your society under the idea of its being unacceptable.`,cn:`而且自从前天散步以后她就又难过又愤怒，以致不吃不喝，就因为我把她从你身旁打发走了，认为你是不会接受她的。`},{en:`It will mean that we shall have had our breakfast of the day before yesterday, our breakfast of yesterday, our dinner of to-day, and all that at once, and this morning.`,cn:`我们会在今天早上把前天的早饭、前天的晚饭、昨天的早饭、昨天的晚饭，做一顿同时全吃下去。 嘿！`}]},{word:`the day after tomorrow`,translation:`后天`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Begin the job the day after tomorrow.`,cn:`后天开始干这活吧。`},{en:`She says the demolition could be today, tomorrow, or the day after tomorrow. She does not know.`,cn:`她说，拆除行动可能就在今天、明天或者后天，具体日期她无法得知。`}]},{word:`weekday`,translation:`n. 工作日`,phonetic:`'wikde`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`If you want to avoid the crowds, it's best to come on a weekday.`,cn:`如果你想避开人流，最好在工作日来。`}]},{word:`look after`,translation:`照顾，照料`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I love looking after the children.`,cn:`我喜欢照顾孩子们。`}]},{word:`invitation`,translation:`n. 邀请；邀请函`,phonetic:`ˌɪnvɪˈteɪʃn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She refused his invitation to the tea party.`,cn:`他请她参加茶会，她拒绝了他的邀请。`}]},{word:`turn down`,translation:`减小，关小，调低`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He kept turning the central heating down.`,cn:`他不断地调低中央暖气系统的温度。`}]},{word:`reply`,translation:`v. 回答，回复`,phonetic:`rɪ'plai`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I asked Clive where he was going, but he didn’t reply.`,cn:`我问克莱夫到哪儿去，但他没有回答。`},{en:`Sorry it took me so long to reply.`,cn:`抱歉，我过了这么久才回复。`},{en:`‘Did you see Simon today?’ ‘Of course,’ Nathalie replied with a smile.`,cn:`“你今天见到西蒙了吗？”“当然啦。”纳萨莉笑着答道。`}]},{word:`forward`,translation:`adv. 向前`,phonetic:`'fɔrwɚd`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`He leaned forward , his elbows resting on the table.`,cn:`他身体前倾，胳膊肘撑在桌子上。`},{en:`The crowd surged forwards.`,cn:`人群向前涌去。`},{en:`She took another small step forward.`,cn:`她又向前走了一小步。`}]},{word:`delete`,translation:`v. 删除`,phonetic:`dɪ'lit`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`His name was deleted from the list.`,cn:`他的名字从名单上删掉了。`},{en:`I deleted the file by mistake.`,cn:`我误删了这个文件。`}]},{word:`print`,translation:`n. 印刷的文字；印花布; v. 印刷；打印；刊载`,phonetic:`prɪnt`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`There was no print at all on the backs of the tickets.`,cn:`门票背面没有印任何文字。`},{en:`the pleasure of seeing my name in print`,cn:`在出版物中看到我名字时的那份喜悦`},{en:`Very little of his poetry actually got into print (= was printed ) .`,cn:`他的诗作鲜有付梓。`},{en:`‘The Express’ was the first paper to print the story.`,cn:`《快报》是首家刊登这一事件的报纸。`},{en:`Print your name and address on a postcard and send it to us.`,cn:`中文例句: 用印刷体将你的名字和地址写在一张明信片上寄给我们。`}]},{word:`sad`,translation:`adj. 难过的；悲哀的，令人悲痛的`,phonetic:`sæd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Dad looked sad and worried as he read the letter.`,cn:`爸爸读着信，看上去又难过又担心。`},{en:`Sorry to hear the sad news .`,cn:`听到这令人伤心的消息我很难过。`}]},{word:`goodbye`,translation:`int. 再见`,phonetic:`gʊd'baɪ`,partOfSpeech:`int`},{word:`take a trip`,translation:`去旅行`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Fred and Jeff are friends. They want to take a trip together.`,cn:`弗雷德和杰夫是朋友，他们想一起去旅行。`}]},{word:`glad`,translation:`adj. 高兴的；乐意的; v. 使...高兴`,phonetic:`ɡlæd`,partOfSpeech:`adj / v`,examples:[{en:`We’re so glad you came.`,cn:`你来了我们真高兴。`},{en:`‘I’ve decided to accept the job.’ ‘I’m glad.’`,cn:`“我决定接受这份工作。”“我很高兴。”`},{en:`We will be glad to send you any information you may need.`,cn:`中文例句: 您若需要什么资料，我们很乐意寄给您。`}]},{word:`preparation`,translation:`n. 准备；准备工作（用复数形式）`,phonetic:`,prɛpə'reʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`This dish is good for dinner parties because much of the preparation can be done ahead of time.`,cn:`这道菜适合宴会，因为很多准备工作可以事先做好。`},{en:`Plans for the new school are now in preparation .`,cn:`新学校的设计图正在绘制中。`},{en:`a course in food service and food preparation`,cn:`餐饮服务和备菜课程`},{en:`Preparations are being made for the President’s visit.`,cn:`正在为迎接总统来访做准备工作。`}]},{word:`glue`,translation:`v. 粘合；盯着某物看（后接to）; n. 胶；各种胶合物`,phonetic:`ɡlu`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Glue the fabric around the window.`,cn:`用胶把这布粘在窗户四周。`},{en:`He was glued to the TV when the Olympics were on.`,cn:`电视上一有奥运会比赛，他就会目不转睛地盯着看。`},{en:`...a tube of glue.`,cn:`…一管胶水。`}]},{word:`without`,translation:`prep. 没有`,phonetic:`wɪðˈaʊt`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`After the storm we were without electricity for five days.`,cn:`暴风雨之后我们断电了五天。`},{en:`a house without a garden`,cn:`不带花园的房子`},{en:`We passed two ruined abbeys, one with a tower and one without.`,cn:`我们路过两座破落的寺院，一座有塔楼，另一座没有。`},{en:`I’m getting used to managing without a car.`,cn:`我已经习惯没有汽车了。`}]},{word:`surprised`,translation:`adj. 感到惊讶的; v. 使惊奇（surprise的过去分词形式）`,phonetic:`sɚ'praɪzd`,partOfSpeech:`adj / v`,examples:[{en:`This lady was genuinely surprised at what happened to her pet.`,cn:`这位女士确实对发生在她宠物身上的事感到吃惊。`}]},{word:`look forward to`,translation:`盼望，期待`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He was looking forward to working with the new manager.`,cn:`他很期待和新经理一起工作。`}]},{word:`hear from`,translation:`收到......来信`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`housewarming`,translation:`n. 乔迁庆宴`,phonetic:`'haʊs,wɔrmɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I'm so sorry I missed the housewarming.`,cn:`很抱歉我没有赶上乔迁聚会。`},{en:`...a housewarming party.`,cn:`...一次庆祝乔迁聚会。`}]},{word:`opening`,translation:`n. 开幕式，落成典礼`,phonetic:`'opənɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the official opening of the new theatre`,cn:`新剧院的正式落成典礼`}]},{word:`concert`,translation:`n. 音乐会`,phonetic:`'kɑnsɚt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a rock concert`,cn:`摇滚音乐会`},{en:`a concert of French choral music`,cn:`法国合唱音乐会`},{en:`We were going to a concert in Bath Abbey.`,cn:`我们要去听一场在巴斯修道院内举行的音乐会。`},{en:`She still does about 100 concerts every year.`,cn:`她每年仍然举行100场左右的演唱会。`}]},{word:`headmaster`,translation:`n. 男校长`,phonetic:`,hɛd'mæstɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`This headmaster is very modest.`,cn:`这位校长很谦虚。`},{en:`Our headmaster rattled on for at least two hours at the opening ceremony.`,cn:`我们的校长在开学典礼上唠唠叨叨地讲了至少两个小时。`},{en:`Before the door of the headmaster's office,she stopped and re-collected herself for a while.`,cn:`在校长办公室门前，她停步片刻使自己镇静下来。`}]},{word:`event`,translation:`n. 大事；公开活动`,phonetic:`ɪ'vɛnt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`one of the most important events in the history of mankind`,cn:`人类历史上最重大的事件之一`},{en:`The conference was an important social event (= an event at which people can meet each other ).`,cn:`那次会议是一次重要的社交活动。`}]},{word:`guest`,translation:`n. 客人`,phonetic:`ɡɛst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a banquet for 250 distinguished guests`,cn:`250位贵宾出席的宴会`},{en:`Among the invited guests were Jerry Brown and Elihu Harris.`,cn:`受邀的嘉宾中有杰里·布朗和伊莱休·哈里斯。`},{en:`The actress was guest of honour (= the most important guest ) at the launch.`,cn:`这位女演员是首发式上的贵宾。`},{en:`I’ve nearly finished the guest list for the wedding.`,cn:`参加婚礼的嘉宾名单我差不多准备好了。`}]},{word:`calendar`,translation:`n. 日历；日程表`,phonetic:`'kæləndɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There was a calendar on the wall above, with large squares around the dates.`,cn:`墙的上方曾有一本日历，日期框在大方格里。`},{en:`This field determines where to display the event on the calendar.`,cn:`该字段决定了在日程表的什么地方显示事件。`}]},{word:`daytime`,translation:`n. 日间，白天`,phonetic:`'detaɪm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Can I take your daytime telephone number (= the number of the telephone you use during the day ) ?`,cn:`你能把你的日间电话号码给我吗？`},{en:`daytime television`,cn:`日间电视节目`}]},{word:`meeting`,translation:`n. 会议；集会；会见; v. 会面；会合（meet的ing形式）`,phonetic:`'mitɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`We’re having a meeting next week to discuss the matter.`,cn:`我们下周将开会讨论此事。`},{en:`I had felt drawn to Alice ever since our first meeting.`,cn:`我第一次见到艾丽斯就感觉被她吸引住了。`}]},{word:`video`,translation:`n. 录像；录像带`,phonetic:`'vɪdɪo`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Let’s stay at home and watch a video.`,cn:`我们待在家里看录像吧。`},{en:`Rewind the video right to the beginning.`,cn:`把录像倒退到开头部分。`},{en:`The school will be making a video of the play.`,cn:`学校将把这出戏拍摄成录像。`},{en:`coming soon to a video store near you`,cn:`录像带商店即将有售`}]},{word:`potato chips`,translation:`n. 马铃薯片；油炸薯片`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`chocolate`,translation:`n. 巧克力`,phonetic:`ˈtʃɑkələt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a chocolate bar`,cn:`巧克力条`},{en:`a chocolate cake`,cn:`巧克力蛋糕`},{en:`a packet of chocolate biscuits`,cn:`一包巧克力饼干`},{en:`I prefer milk chocolate to dark chocolate .`,cn:`和黑巧克力比起来，我更喜欢牛奶巧克力。`}]},{word:`upset`,translation:`adj. 难过的，失望的`,phonetic:`ʌp'sɛt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`After she died I felt very, very upset.`,cn:`她死后，我感觉非常非常难过。`},{en:`Marta looked upset.`,cn:`玛尔塔看起来很沮丧。`}]},{word:`taxi`,translation:`v. 滑行；乘出租车；用出租车送; n. 出租汽车`,phonetic:`'tæksi`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`The plane taxied to a halt.`,cn:`飞机滑行一段距离后停下来。`},{en:`The taxi drew up in front of the Riviera Club.`,cn:`该出租车在里维埃拉俱乐部前停了下来。`}]},{word:`advice`,translation:`n. 劝告，建议`,phonetic:`ədˈvaɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`You should have followed my advice.`,cn:`你真该听我的建议。`}]},{word:`travel`,translation:`v. 旅行；走过（某距离）；（以某速度）行进`,phonetic:`'trævl`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`We travelled by train across Eastern Europe.`,cn:`我们乘火车穿越东欧。`},{en:`They travelled 200 miles on the first day.`,cn:`他们第一天行进了200英里。`}]},{word:`agent`,translation:`n. 代理人，经纪人`,phonetic:`'edʒənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Our agent in Rio deals with all our Brazilian business.`,cn:`我们在里约热内卢的业务代表处理我们在巴西的全部业务。`}]},{word:`expert`,translation:`n. 专家，能手`,phonetic:`'ɛkspɝt; (for adj., also) ɛksˈpɝt ; ɪkˈspɝt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She proclaimed herself an expert.`,cn:`她自封为专家。`},{en:`We had an expert appraise the house before we bought it.`,cn:`我们在买房之前让一名专家对房子进行了估价。`}]},{word:`keep…to oneself`,translation:`保守秘密`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`teenager`,translation:`n. 青少年`,phonetic:`'tinedʒɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a TV sex education series aimed at teenagers`,cn:`一部针对青少年的性教育电视系列片`}]},{word:`normal`,translation:`adj. 正常的`,phonetic:`'nɔrml`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`A normal working week is 40 hours.`,cn:`一个正常的工作周是40小时。`},{en:`She was assessed in the normal way, and placed on the waiting list.`,cn:`她接受了正常的评估后被列入等候名单。`},{en:`All I want is to lead a normal life.`,cn:`我想要的只是能过正常的生活。`}]},{word:`unless`,translation:`conj. 除非，如果不`,phonetic:`ən'lɛs`,partOfSpeech:`conj`,examples:[{en:`Unless some extra money is found, the theatre will close.`,cn:`要是不能找到更多资金，剧院将要关闭。`},{en:`I think you should complain – unless, of course, you are happy with the way things are.`,cn:`我觉得你应该发发牢骚——当然，除非你对现状很满意。`},{en:`He won’t go to sleep unless you tell him a story.`,cn:`要是你不给他讲故事他就不睡觉。`},{en:`I can’t leave her unless I know she’s all right.`,cn:`除非我知道她没事，否则我不能离开她。`}]},{word:`certainly`,translation:`adv. 当然，肯定`,phonetic:`'sɝtnli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`‘I’d like a beer, please.’ ‘Certainly, sir.’`,cn:`“请给我来杯啤酒。”“好的，先生。”`},{en:`‘Can I come along?’ ‘Certainly.’`,cn:`“我可以一起去吗？”“当然可以。”`}]},{word:`wallet`,translation:`n. 皮夹，钱包`,phonetic:`'wɑlɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He took a credit card out of his wallet.`,cn:`他从钱包里拿出一张信用卡。`}]},{word:`mile`,translation:`n. 英里；较大的距离`,phonetic:`maɪl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It’s 40 miles from here to the Polish border.`,cn:`从这里到波兰边界有40英里。`},{en:`an area 50 miles wide and 150 miles long`,cn:`一片50英里宽、150英里长的地区`},{en:`We walked about half a mile .`,cn:`我们大约走了半英里。`},{en:`He was driving at 70 miles per hour .`,cn:`他正以每小时70英里的速度驾车行驶。`},{en:`They lived in a little cottage miles from anywhere (= a long way from the nearest town ) .`,cn:`他们住在很偏僻的一间小屋里。`}]},{word:`angry`,translation:`adj. 生气的，发怒的`,phonetic:`ˈæŋgrɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I was angry because he hadn’t told me his plans.`,cn:`我很生气，因为他没有告诉我他的计划。`},{en:`He was beginning to get angry .`,cn:`他开始发脾气了。`},{en:`His comments brought an angry response from opposition politicians.`,cn:`他的话激起反对派政客愤怒的回应。`},{en:`‘Calm down,’ she said, looking at his angry face.`,cn:`“冷静一下。”她看着他那张生气的脸说道。`},{en:`Jesse laughed, which made me even angrier .`,cn:`杰西笑了起来，这令我更加恼火。`}]},{word:`understanding`,translation:`adj. 善解人意的，体谅人的`,phonetic:`,ʌndɚ'stændɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The principal listened to the boy’s story with sympathy and understanding.`,cn:`校长满怀同情和理解地倾听那个男孩的讲述。`}]},{word:`careless`,translation:`adj. 粗心的，不小心的`,phonetic:`'kɛrləs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`It was careless of him to leave the door unlocked.`,cn:`他忘了锁门，真是粗心大意。`},{en:`a careless mistake`,cn:`粗心造成的错误`},{en:`careless driving`,cn:`粗心驾驶`},{en:`Careless talk can be disastrous for a business.`,cn:`谈话不慎有时会给企业带来灾难性的损失。`}]},{word:`mistake`,translation:`n. 错误，失误`,phonetic:`mɪ'stek`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The most common mistake is to plant them too deep.`,cn:`最常见的错误就是把它们种得太深了。`}]},{word:`himself`,translation:`pron. 他自己；他亲自，他本人`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`He poured himself a whisky and sat down in the chair.`,cn:`他给自己倒了一杯威士忌，然后坐在椅子里。`}]},{word:`careful`,translation:`adj. 小心的；细致的，周密的`,phonetic:`'kɛrfl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Be careful - the floor’s slippery.`,cn:`小心——地板很滑。`},{en:`Any school trip requires careful planning.`,cn:`学校的任何出游活动都需要周密的安排。`}]},{word:`advise`,translation:`v. 劝告，建议`,phonetic:`əd'vaɪz`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She needed someone to advise her.`,cn:`她需要有个人给她出主意。`},{en:`‘Make sure that you keep the documents in a safe place,’ Otley advised him.`,cn:`“一定要把文件放在安全的地方。”奥特利向他建议道。`}]},{word:`solve`,translation:`v. 解决；解答`,phonetic:`sɑlv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Charlie thinks money will solve all his problems.`,cn:`查理认为钱能解决他所有的问题。`},{en:`the best way of solving our dilemma`,cn:`解决我们两难处境的最佳办法`}]},{word:`step`,translation:`n. 步，脚步；步伐；步骤；梯级; v. 踏，踩；走；走，迈步`,phonetic:`stɛp`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`a video of baby’s first steps`,cn:`一盒婴儿学步的录像带`},{en:`He took one step and fell.`,cn:`他走了一步就跌倒了。`},{en:`I had to retrace my steps (= go back the way I came ) several times before I found the shop.`,cn:`我来回走了几次才找到那家商店。`},{en:`This is the first step in reforming the welfare system.`,cn:`这是福利制度改革的第一步。`},{en:`Jenny sat on the step in front of the house, waiting.`,cn:`珍妮坐在房前的台阶上等着。`},{en:`I accidentally stepped in a puddle.`,cn:`我不小心踩进了水坑。`}]},{word:`trust`,translation:`n. 相信，信任`,phonetic:`trʌst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`At first there was a lack of trust between them.`,cn:`起初，他们之间缺乏信任。`},{en:`an agreement made on the basis of mutual trust`,cn:`在相互信任的基础上达成的一项协议`},{en:`You betrayed your father’s trust (= did something bad even though he trusted you ) .`,cn:`你辜负了你父亲对你的信任。`}]},{word:`experience`,translation:`n. 经验；经历`,phonetic:`ɪk'spɪrɪəns`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The advice in the booklet reflects the practical experience we have gained (= experience gained by actually doing something, rather than knowledge from books etc ).`,cn:`小册子中的建议反映了我们所获得的实践经验。`},{en:`I had some experience in fashion design.`,cn:`我有一些时装设计方面的经验。`},{en:`She was turned down on the grounds of lack of experience.`,cn:`她因缺乏经验而被拒绝。`},{en:`I have first-hand experience (= experience gained by doing something myself ) of running a school.`,cn:`我有办学的亲身经验。`},{en:`In his experience, women did not like getting their feet wet and muddy.`,cn:`据他的经验来看，妇女不喜欢脚上沾到水或泥。`}]},{word:`in half`,translation:`分成两半,一半`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Divide it in half.`,cn:`把它分成两半。`},{en:`Imagine a vertical line splitting your body in half --your hands should not cross it.`,cn:`想像一条把你的身体分成两半的垂直线--你的手不应该越过它。`}]},{word:`halfway`,translation:`adv. 中途地；半路地`,phonetic:`,hæf'we`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`He was halfway up the ladder.`,cn:`他梯子上到了一半。`}]},{word:`else`,translation:`adj. 别的，其他的; adv. 还能有别的……`,phonetic:`ɛls`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`中文例句：我还有其他事情要谈一谈。`,cn:`英文例句：There’s something else I’d like to talk about as well.`},{en:`‘What are you doing?’ ‘Waiting for you, what else?’`,cn:`“你在干什么？”“在等你呗，还能做什么？”`}]}];export{e as default};